3b','bd5666c083a6db1d77eddad6a3538ec4a2f1182b7c756a7d581858eec30f2c58','HTML','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司电力分公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">矸石电厂</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锅炉中修项目</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">谈判采购</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">变更</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、内容</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：现将我公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年8月25日在中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上发布的：陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司电力分公司矸石电厂1#、3#锅炉中修项目谈判采购公告进行变更，具体内容如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1、原谈判采购变更公告(1)资质要求：供应商必须是中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；供应商需提供须提供所维修锅炉对应的有效《特种设备生产许可证》（锅炉制造）B级及以上证书，具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">现</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1)资质要求变更为：供应商必须是中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；供应商需提供须提供的有效的《特种设备生产许可证》，许可范围包含锅炉修理，具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2、获取时间变更为：2026年08月28日08时30分至2026年09月02日18时00分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3、响应文件递交的截止时间变更为：2026年9月9日09时00分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4、谈判开始时间变更为：2026年9月9日09时00分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、其它内容保持不变，请参见原谈判采购公告。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 156.3500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-ansi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">次谈判采购公告同时在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span>http://www.cebpubservice.com/<span style=\"font-fami