 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">POR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目场外工艺及供热外管工程项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间（投标文件递交截止时间）变更如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，将加