n style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接收。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）开标方式：通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分钟。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其余内容不变。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、监督部门</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话：</span>0912-3732054</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督邮箱：</span>swb@shccig.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; l