=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">现变更为：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1 资格预审申请文件递交的截止时间：2026年07月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">22</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其余内容保持不变。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 3.9000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 5.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次资格预审变更公告在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.sntba.com/）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）和中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 3.9000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 5.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司规划部</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">郑先生</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">029-33191601</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2236744@qq.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议渠道及方式：申请人或其他利害关系人对本资格预审公告及资格预审文件内容有异议的，应在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资格预审申请文件递交截止时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2日前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4）有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 3.9000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 5.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、联系方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省咸阳市秦都区世纪大道中段</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">58号彬长大厦14层</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 10.1000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：郑先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 3.9000pt 0.0000pt