\">概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陈家山煤矿</span>4092<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面开采</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4-2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤层，自然发火期短，且受特厚煤层综放开采、上覆及相邻采空区、再生顶板裂隙、老空区积水边界和瓦斯抽采扰动共同影响，煤自燃灾害具有较强隐蔽性和动态性。</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面煤自燃灾害具有明显的多源耦合特征</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面局部顶板为再生顶板，受上分层采动、历史黄泥灌浆和长期地温地压作用影响，顶板结构非均质性强，裂隙、孔隙和胶结薄弱面可能成为隐蔽漏风通道；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">区段受上覆</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">409</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采空区及相邻</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">407</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">411/4112</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采空区影响，老空区边界复杂，部分区域存在采空区积水及历史灌浆水影响，积水边界变化和干湿交替可能改变遗煤含水状态及氧化活性；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面瓦斯治理以抽放为主、风排为辅，高位钻孔、采空区埋管抽采和上隅角治理在降低瓦斯风险的同时，也可能改变采空区压差分布和漏风路径，导致新鲜风流沿再生顶板裂隙、钻孔影响区及封堵薄弱区进入遗煤富集区域。因此，围绕</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">特厚煤层综放工作面煤自燃灾害防治需求，亟须开展特厚煤层综放工作面多源灾害耦合致灾链一体化协同防控研究，为工作面安全回采提供技术支撑，为陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司后续类似工作面煤自燃灾害治理提供示范依据。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.2000pt; margin-left: 0.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）实验测试</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面煤自燃特性参数，构建</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面多因素条件下的煤自燃监测预警体系，指导工作面煤自燃早期监测与预警工作；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）研究</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面采空区以及上覆</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">409</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采空区在瓦斯抽采扰动下采空区氧浓度场特性，掌握采空区漏风供氧规律测试，开展</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面不同开采时期（初采、正常回采、末采）采空区漏风测试工程，明确</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面采空区以及上覆</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">409</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采空区主要漏风通道、漏风路径、漏风强度，为精准封堵通道提供依据；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）研究匹配工作面推进度的动态</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三带</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">判定及危险区域划分方法，掌握</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下分层工作面回采过程中自燃</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三带</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">与危险区域，明确上分层老空区的连通影响，为采空区注氮、封堵、隔离等防治措施提供依据；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）研究特厚煤层综放采空区煤自燃多源耦合致灾机理，明确瓦斯抽采负压扰动、多采空区沟通条件下的漏风特征及其对煤自燃与瓦斯耦合灾害的影响过程，为一体化协同防控技术体系构建提供流程依据；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）构建</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面多源灾害耦合致灾链一体化协同防控技术体系，分析现有防灭火技术的适应性，结合</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面及上分层灾害形成特点，建立分区、分时、分级的致灾链一体化协同防控技术方案，形成企业技术标准规范；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）全程跟踪</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面防灭火工作，派驻专业技术人员协助矿方指导</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4092</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面防灭火工作，依据工作面实际生产情况，及时分析煤自然发火监测数据，判定工作面采空区煤自燃状态，提出合理的防灭火方案。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月完成项目研发工作，验收时间双方协商确定。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务地点：</span></span><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E9%99%95%E8%A5%BF%E7%9C%81/19657132?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省</span></span></a><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E9%93%9C%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82/8024779?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">铜川市</span></span></a><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%80%80%E5%B7%9E%E5%8C%BA/246653?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">耀州区</span></span></a><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%BA%99%E6%B9%BE%E9%95%87/220487?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">庙湾镇</span></span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陈家山煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427365\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11852\"></a><a name=\"_Toc428196411\"></a>3.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427366\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196412\"></a>3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">拟派项目负责人须具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤矿相关专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（如安全工程、矿业工程等相关专业）高级及以上职称</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年1月1日起在本单位连续缴纳3个月及以上的社保证明（依法免缴社保的须提供证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><s