erning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26C3SXQY0624</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc6076\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196409\"></a>1.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目深埋煤层群下分层冲击地压综放面顺槽反复扰动大变形灾害孕育机理与</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三位一体</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">综合防治成套技术研究项目（即强采动影响下大巷群围岩变形机理及卸</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">支协同全断面控制技术研究项目），资金为企业自筹，项目已具备招标条件，招标人为陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196410\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc438\"></a><a name=\"_Toc399427364\"></a>2.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况及招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：深埋煤层群下分层冲击地压综放面顺槽反复扰动大变形灾害孕育机理与</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三位一体</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">综合防治成套技术研究项目（即强采动影响下大巷群围岩变形机理及卸</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">支协同全断面控制技术研究项目）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc20281\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目以下石节煤矿强采动条件下大巷群严重变形失稳为工程背景，围绕采空区覆岩悬臂梁结构诱发超前支承压力持续作用、大巷围岩反复破坏失稳的核心问题，综合运用现场调研、室内试验、理论分析、数值模拟及井下工业试验等手段，旨在揭示多煤层开采条件下覆岩破断应力传递规律与大巷群围岩变形破坏机理，阐明</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">卸压</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">支护</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">协同作用机制；在此基础上，研发以停采线密集孔水力压裂断顶降载、大巷定向长钻孔水力压裂卸压</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应力阻隔、大巷群差异化高强支护及底板锚网加固为核心的全断面协同控制技术，形成一套主动、高效、经济的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">水力压裂切顶降载 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应力阻隔 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高强度差异化支护</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的协同控制技术体系；通过在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">231</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面前方</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">950</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">轨道大巷、皮带大巷、回风大巷及东翼回风巷开展现场工业性试验，实现强采动条件下大巷围岩的长期有效控制，终结</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">前采后修、反复扩巷</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的恶性循环，大幅降低巷道维护成本，保障矿井安全高效生产，并为公司类似条件矿井的巷道围岩控制提供可复制推广的技术规范。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.2000pt; margin-left: 0.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）揭示多煤层联合布置条件下覆岩</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">悬臂梁</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">砌体梁</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">复合结构的联动失稳特征及其对大巷群的长期持续加载机制，研发</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">密集孔水力压裂断顶降载</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">定向长钻孔卸压</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应力阻隔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">复合卸压技术，形成</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一巷一策</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">差异化支护与全断面协同控制技术体系。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）构建能量场立体成像及力</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">能</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">震</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">压多维监测的卸压</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">支护效果评价技术。采用曲线</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">云图</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">数字的形式分析卸压</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">支护效果，囊括：覆岩关键层结构智能识别、采动能量场</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2D </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3D </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成像、地质冲击风险区智能划分和数据驱动联合分析、冲击危险性指数定量表征、损伤频次和能量密集度及孕育指数分析、长短期损伤空间密集度分析以及大巷周边区域应力分布的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CT</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">反演定期探查等。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）研发覆岩结构随钻快速检测技术，建立钻进响应信号（推力、扭矩、钻速、振动等）与覆岩岩性界面、分层厚度及岩石强度之间的定量化映射关系，实现基于机器学习算法的覆岩结构快速探查。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）避免采空区上方顶板形成</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">悬臂梁</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">结构对大巷的持续影响，巷道围岩变形量应得到有效控制，使顶板基本完整，两帮和底鼓变形量减小</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">70%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上，巷道维修工程量大幅减少，形成完整的现场监测数据库和工业性试验报告。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）发表高水平学术论文</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">～</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">篇。申请发明专利</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">～</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项，申报</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项省部级科技进步奖或国家级行业协会奖。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期：合同签订生效后一年内完成项目研发测试和验收工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务地点：陕西省铜川市印台区</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司下石节煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196411\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427365\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11852\"></a>3.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196412\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427366\"></a>3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：投标人须是中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">拟派项目负责人须具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤矿相关专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（如</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采矿</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">力学</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地质</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">岩土</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">等相关专业）高级及以上职称</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">拟派至本项目的技术人员不少于</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人，且须</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤矿相关专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（如</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-f