'2026-09-08 15:58:36',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'建庄矿业五盘区西部地质补充勘探招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260908/1281913938220417024.html','001ca942d6e2e5b708c2ec18059db7b533e6888d4e3972d0637e2c6db24a5702','e5818c086c9b9d9a745c12e32126f35505aed586779f3de18794098dcb518a16','HTML','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">建庄矿业五盘区</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">西部地质补充勘探</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">0866-26D3SXQY0547</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地：陕西省，延安市，黄陵县</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本建庄矿业五盘区西部地质补充勘探已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为其他资金（企业自筹，比例100%），招标人为陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司。本项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、项目概况：建庄矿业公司五盘区原勘探程度不足，不能满足五盘区生产需求，已在盘区中部及东部地表相对位置完成地质补勘钻孔</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">施工</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，为进一步查明盘区西部煤层赋存情况，为采掘布局及安全顺利生产提供详实准确的地质资料，现需开展五盘区西部地质补充勘探。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、招标范围：通过工程测量、钻探工程、地球物理测井、采</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样测试等勘查手段，对五盘区西部进行补勘工作，五盘区西部地表相对位置施工地质钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5个，设计总工作量3185m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、服务期限：合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">270日历天</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、服务地点：陕西省延安市陕西煤业集团黄陵建庄矿业有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5、质量标准：满足相关规范、标准要求，通过专家的评审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">资质要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年01月01日至投标截止日）具有至少一份煤矿</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">地质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">勘探项目业绩（以合同为准，至少包含合同首页、工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">08</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08时30分到2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">15</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、经招标机构确认后，投标人可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;选择&ldquo;网上支付&rdquo;扫码办理招标文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、购买招标文件的发票，待招标机构开出后投标人可在平台下载（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">30</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接收。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">30</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、本项目招标公告仅在陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com/）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）和中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、秦源招标电子招投标平台（二期）投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241016/1031244793008619520.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、投标人须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。秦源招标二期投标客户端下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5、提出异议的渠道和联系方式：联系人：陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司审计部；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0913-7560129；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">电子</s