>（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购编号</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26D2SXQY0521</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">一、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">采购条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2027年度集中采购项目（JDT链条及接链环）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">采购人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）。本项目已具备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">采购条件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，现</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">采购方式</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">公开准入</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">二、项目概况与</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">采购</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">规模：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">JDT链条及接链环</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">范围：本项目划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个标段，本次为其中的：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(001)</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">JDT链条及接链环。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">供应商</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.资质要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或其他组织</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）该项目接受代理商。若为代理商，必须取得国外生产制造商或其驻中国办事处、分子公司或合资公司出具的省级及以上授权（授权范围必须涵盖陕西全省行政区域）。若授权书为国外生产制造商驻中国办事处、分子公司或合资公司出具的，则须同时提供国外生产制造商与其中国办事处、分子公司或合资公司的关系证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须提供拟投品牌产品的矿用产品安全标志证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">MA证书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）供应商须</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供赋码后的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年度</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">经审计的财务审计报告【至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）】</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备可查询（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提供网页查询截图</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">信誉要求（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">以供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">四、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">准入文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年09月0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08时30分到2026年09月1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">18时00分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.供应商须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.注册完成后，供应商登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.经采购代理机构确认后，供应商在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）办理购买准入文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载准入文件。采购文件费用：300元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.供应商须在上述规定的准入文件获取时间内按要求提交相关材料。逾期提交或材料不齐的将被拒绝受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.购买准入文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载（购买准入文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">五、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">响应文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年10月13日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">递交方式：电子</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">响应</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;，未在</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">响应文件递交截止时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">前成功递交的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">响应文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">将被拒绝接受。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开启</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">六、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开启时间</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开启时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: