=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">蒲洁能化特种聚丙烯项目（第二、三阶段）考古发掘技术服务项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-center\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-align: center; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">直接采购公示</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">蒲城清洁能源化工有限责任公司蒲洁能化特种聚丙烯项目（第二、三阶段）考古发掘技术服务项目采购拟采用直接采购方式进行采购，特此公示。</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">一、潜在供应商</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">陕西省考古研究院</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">二、谈判采购依据</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">蒲洁能化特种聚丙烯项目（第二、三阶段）考古发掘技术服务项目，该项目不属于依法必须招标项目。蒲洁能化特种聚丙烯项目位于项目位于陕西省渭南市蒲城县煤化工业园区，第一阶段考古发掘古代墓葬32座，技术工作已由陕西省考古研究院实施发掘，二、三阶段勘探发现古代墓葬5座。根据《陕西省文物保护条例》第二十九条，建设工程施工，需要进行考古发掘的，应当由省文物行政主管部门提出发掘计划；《陕西省基本建设工程考古工作管理办法》（陕政办发〔2022〕33 号）第二条&ensp;&ensp;基建考古工作由省级文物行政部门协调管理并组织实施，陕西省考古研究院是陕西省专门从事考古调查、文勘、发掘与研究的科研机构，承担全省文化遗产保护及科研任务。作为省属科研单位，其主要职责包括考古调查、发掘与研究。鉴于上述情况，本项目拟与</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">陕西省考古研究院</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">进行直接采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">三、公示期限</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">2026年9月8日至2026年9月11日</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">四、提出异议的渠道和方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; font-family: 等线; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; letter-spacing: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-font-family=\"宋体\">4.1有关单位对公示内容如有异议，请于公示期内书面向采购人提出，逾期将不予受理。提出的异议书应包含下列内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph 