\">本次第四届拓展训练</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">委托服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目谈判采购已获批准实施，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">实施</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资金自筹，发包人为陕西榆横铁路有限责任公司。项目已具备谈判条件，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">方式为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">谈判采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.项目名称与</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">概况</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采购项目名称：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第四届拓展训练</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">委托服务项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2采购人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西榆横铁路有限责任公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3采购项目资金落实情况：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">企业自筹，出资率</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4采购项目概况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为深入推进公司平安建设、安全生产、综治维稳、健康企业工作落地见效，进一步强化全员安全责任意识、岗位协作意识与团队凝聚力，切实夯实公司安全发展根基。根据年度计划，于近期组织开展第四届</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;筑牢安全防线 聚力护航发展&rdquo;全员拓展训练暨平安榆横专题实践活动，活动以开展各类团建项目实施，结合实弹射击体验项目，本次</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个包件（具体内容见竞争性谈判文件）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5 成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一家，成交份额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 采购范围：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">在榆林市区户外营地组织开展拓展训练，要求具备露营地服务、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拓展</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">活动、实弹射击、餐饮住宿、场地策划、摄影等能力，具体详见谈判采购文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 服务期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同签订之日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10日内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 服务地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">榆林市及周边地区。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.谈判承包人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1 供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 31.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）营业执照：供应商必须具备独立法人资格，具有有效的企业法人营业执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）财务要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">企业营业正常，未有处于被责令停业、财产被接管、冻结或破产的情况</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供近三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止日前）已完成类似项目业绩不少于</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项（业绩以合同证明材料为准。至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章页，有效日期以合同签订日期为准）【每份业绩提供对应的非等额结算发票扫描件一张，须包含付款方、收款方、发票代码、发票号码且清晰完整（发票开具日期为本项目公告前）】。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）信誉要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具有良好的社会信誉，未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信企业名单，未被信用中国（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）列入失信企业目录；未列入中国执行信息公开网失信企业目录（http://zxgk.court.gov.cn/index.jsp）；未被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;供应（合作）商黑名单&rdquo;且在公布期内</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">(提供加盖公章的承诺书或证明材料)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）承担本项目的主要人员要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.项目负责人：熟悉户外拓展安全管理规范、应急预案流程，具备项目整体方案落地、现场统筹、突发事故处置能力；无安全事故记录、无行业不良从业记录。2.训练教练：具备丰富的团队拓展、素质训练带队经验，能够独立完成破冰团建、团队协作、素质提升、复盘总结等全流程教学工作；无从业不良记录，熟悉户外场地训练规范，具备基础安全风险识别能力。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6）其他要求：无</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2 供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）企业因骗取中标或者严重违约以及发生重大事故、被有关部门暂停投标资格并在暂停期内的；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）为采购人不具有独立法人资格的附属机构（单位）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.3 本次采购不接受联合体。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日（节假日不休），每日上午</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8：00时至1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0时，下午 14：00时至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0时（北京时间，下同）, 到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">榆林市西南新区凤凰新城陕西榆横铁路有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">持法定代表人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">或</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">授权委托书（须有法定代表人、授权委托人签字）、受托人身份证复印件、法人身份证复印件及第</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">条要求的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资料</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">复印</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(加盖公章)到</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公司二楼企业管理部领取</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">谈判文件。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、响应文件的递交</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">.1 谈判文件递交的截止时间（谈判截止时间，下同）为20</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">11</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">:</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">00</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">点</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，地点为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西榆横铁路有限责任公司三楼会议室</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">.2 逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的谈判文件，谈判人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交响应文件的供应商应委派代表准时参加谈判活动，谈判开始预计为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; li