;\">项目所在地：陕西省，</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span>1500<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">大机组</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">维保</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 20.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目通过引入专业、合规、有实力的第三方维保服务单位，对二期一阶段汽轮机和离心压缩机实施全周期、标准化、专业化运维保障，确保装置安全稳定长周期运行，最终保障项目高效投产、平稳运行、达标达产</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 20.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标项目为二期一阶段大型离心式压缩机组、轴流式压缩机组及汽轮机组的日常维护、状态监测、劣化分析以及机组的大、中、小修等工作。维保大机组明细表见附件六《大机组设备一览表》。在投标人执行合同期间增加的大机组也作为维保的工作内容</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。具体维保工作范围包括但不限于：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 20.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责维保范围内机组的主机及其部分辅机</span>/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">辅助系统的维护、检修工作。维保工作范围包含机组的日常维护、定期检查以及《石油化工行业检修工程预算定额》（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2021 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">版）和 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SHS</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《石油化工维护检修规程》当中的大、中、小修。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 20.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人维保范围包括但不限于上述内容，由于技术改造等增加在承包范围内的设备及辅助系统的维护、检修均由投标人负责。为保证招标人机组的生产达标、安全、清洁文明、稳定、经济生产而开展的所有相关工作，以及安全大检查的配合及消缺等工作，都属于投标人维保工作内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自合同签订</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生效</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之日起两年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">正式</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开始实施日期</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以招标人通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量标准：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">符合国家石油化工及煤化工行业检修、施工的验收规范、质量评定标准、安全操作规程、检修规程、设备随机说明书以及招标人制定的维护检修规程等，质量合格。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 20.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 20.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具有石油化工工程施工总承包</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级及以上资质，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效的《安全生产许可证》</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、业绩要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span>2021<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">石油化工或煤化工</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">离心式压缩机</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\">或</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">汽轮机的</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本体</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">大修</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效业绩以合同为准。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等（可提供技术协议补充</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经项目建设单位加盖有效公章的书面证明文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，以此完成相关内容佐证</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、人员要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目经理：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具有</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">机械类专业助理工程师</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上职称，或持有高级工及以上职业资格证书，且</span>2021<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期间，至少以维保项目副经理及以上在岗岗位身份承担过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤化工或石油化工装置维保类项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；业绩证明材料以项目合同、业主单位业绩证明二者其一为准，材料中须清晰体现本人员姓名及对应任职岗位。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经理</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为本单位在职员工，并提供社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起以后连续</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、财务要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、信誉要求：（下列要求仅提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未被列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未被列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">(1)&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目不接受联合体投标，资格审查方式为资格后审；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">(2)&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、获取时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>8<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">11</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、获取方式：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载招</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具体操作步骤如下</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】，按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每套</span>500<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，客服电话：</span>400-685-1179<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载网址：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">29</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span>9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">29</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span>9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、开标方式：通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分钟。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span>http://www.cebpubservice.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sntba.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）及秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八、监督部门</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span>0912-3732054</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督邮箱</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span>swb@shccig.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span>10<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）提出异议的日期。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">十、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园汇源大道</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：商务部刘工</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"