ing: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">必须具备市政公用工程施工总承包</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">二</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">级及以上资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具有有效的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">《</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">安全生产许可</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">》</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）投标人必须具备有效的《特种设备生产许可证》压力管道安装 GB2（公用热力管道）资质。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（项目经理）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">拟派项目负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具有市政公用工程专业二级及以上注册建造师</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">资格，具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B类）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，且不得在其他在建工程项目担任</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及技术负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（提供无在建项目承诺）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）技术负责人：须具有</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">市政工程相关专业</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">中级及以上工程师职称；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）安全负责人：具有有效的</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">《</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">安全生产考核合格证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">》</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">C类）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）项目负责人（项目经理）、技术负责人、安全负责人为本单位在职员工，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">人员配备不能相互兼职，</span><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须为本单位在册职工，须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年10月以后至少6个月社会保</span></span><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3、财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年&mdash;2025年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表），若投标人成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人新成立不足</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表或提供开户行出具的银行资信证明，财务报表应包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人必须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2023年1月1日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">至投标文件递交截止时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">类似新建或改造换热站项目业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不少于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1份（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">证明文件以合同</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">及至少任意一张发票</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">为准，合同复印件应清晰明了，有合同签署双方的盖章页，合同复印件应加盖公章</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">发票信息无遮挡</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">信誉要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">:</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 15.6000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(1) </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)严重失信</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">主体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">名单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 15.6000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(2) </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6其他要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人基本信息在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（提供截图）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc21312\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.1获取时间：2026年9月5日8时00分至2026年9月11日18时00分（法定节假日期间接受文件购买）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.2获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系統，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;3．投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标客户端、数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：</span></span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.3招标文件费用：500元/套，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.4购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行下载并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc1322\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间