y: 宋体;\">0 号柴油，油品质量符合国（Ⅵ）标准，执行《车用柴油（Ⅵ）》（GB 19147-2016）国家标准</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购数量约为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">350吨，其中佳县站约90吨、清涧站约90吨、延长站约80吨、黄龙站约90吨。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 2.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订后，采购人根据实际需求通知供货，投标人须在接到通知后</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3 个日历天内送达指定地点。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 2.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5质保期：6个月</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 2.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5交货地点：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 2.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc156232405\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc156232362\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）地址：陕西省榆林市榆佳高速王家砭收费站出口延302省道30公里陕西神渭管运公司佳县站</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNorma