办理缴费后投标人即可下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">常用文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc3809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26117\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><a name=\"_Toc25862\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.7</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc17240\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc8606\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服电话</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 400-685-1179；邮箱:qyebidding@163.com；咨询日期:法定工作日；咨询时间:08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc5339\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc26517\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6，咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc26844\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: