tchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">严重失信主体名单</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">以投标人加盖公章的承诺书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">为准）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">未列入</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">www.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">gsxt</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">以投标人加盖公章的承诺书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">为准）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span><a name=\"_Hlk92988367\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目接受代理商投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">需提供生产厂家出具的授权经销证书（针对本项目有效）、同一品牌仅允许一家供应商参与投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）本次招标不接受联合体投标（包括使用两个以上不同名称的同一单位）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">4.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427367\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.1获取时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时到202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时（北京时间，下同）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc2219\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc16722\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12419\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.2 获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）上传，投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.3未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;手册及开标注意事项。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.4投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：500元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc969735531\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16887\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1833\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26117\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31251\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.7有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc17240\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc25427\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10346\"></a><a name=\"_Toc8342\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1265555972\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服电话</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 400-685-1179；邮箱:qyebidding@163.com；咨询日期:法定工作日；咨询时间:08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_Toc3849\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc1646337601\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20113\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28061\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26517\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6，咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5．</span><a name=\"_Toc363568583\"></a><a name=\"_Toc356895431\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.1 投标文件递交的截止时间（开标时间）：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年9月29日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9时00分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.2递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"