.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm 。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">．</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目的监督部门：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司规划部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 42.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：郑先生</span> &nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">029-33191601</span><span style=\"ms