ght: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">56805</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D2SXQY0465',NULL,NULL,'陕西火石咀煤矿有限责任公司掘进工作面带式输送机用自移机尾采购项目','陕西火石咀煤矿有限责任公司','2026-09-04 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:00:56','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097233742487781378,'1','2026-09-08 16:01:04','1','2026-09-08 16:01:04',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'二期&一期高压蒸汽(一期变换装置合成气余热回收)、高压氧气(一期空分冷箱改造)互联互通项目详细设计及其相关技术服务招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260904/1280454197631778816.html','b2672fe2622c1f9a81a60563f8bfeeb0f824b10043069423fbcccb4d0e89f103','741708f3551e8ce43060b5de1e83364a7f888436f2adc0d8e2f248edff83f5df','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">二期&amp;一期高压蒸汽(一期变换装置合成气余热回收)、高压氧气(一期空分冷箱改造)互联互通项目详细设计及其相关技术服务</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26B3SXQY0504</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地：陕西省</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一期高压蒸汽（一期变换装置合成气余热回收）、高压氧气（一期空分冷箱改造）互联互通项目详细设计及其相关技术服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司在陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园布局建设了煤炭分质利用制化工新材料示范项目，一期：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">180</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年乙二醇工程（已建成投产）；二期：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目（正在建设）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期项目建成运行后，二期向一期提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12.5MPaG</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">525</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">℃和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.2MPaG</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">260</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">℃两个等级蒸汽，一期根据二期供汽情况停、开相应台数的锅炉。因动力锅炉停开导致锅炉供水随之减少，使除盐水站送变换装置预热的除盐水带走的变换装置热量减少，导致变换装置变换气和未变换气热量过剩，无法通过现有循环水换热器将变换送低温甲醇洗的工艺气冷却至目标温度。为保证一期变换装置通过技术改造，增设低压蒸汽发生器和循环水换热器等设备，确保一期变换装置送低温甲醇洗工艺气各项指标符合原始设计要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在二期工程建成后，其高压氧气管网需与一期工程进行互联互通，正常用气需求为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">Nm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。因一期空分设计氧量为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">Nm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup2;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，但是实际运行时下游装置最大使用量为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">23.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">Nm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup2;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，导致三套空分均在极限低负荷运行，部分高压氧气长时间放空，为了降低运营成本。通过二期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一期高压氧气（一期空分冷箱改造）互联互通项目，拟改造一期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">K1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">空分装置，将其高压氧气产品压力由</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">54bara</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提升至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">78bara</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，其中一部分高压氧减压后满足一期需求，剩余部分通过管线输送至二期空分管网；在特殊情况下（如一期装置停车、检修等），也存在将二期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">Nm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高压氧气经减压后送至一期装置运行工况。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为完成二期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一期高压蒸汽（一期变换装置合成气余热回收）、高压氧气（一期空分冷箱改造）互联互通项目详细设计及其相关技术服务，满足现场施工需求，故特外委第三方公司开展本次设计服务工作。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一期高压蒸汽（一期变换装置合成气余热回收）互联互通项目改造过程中相关工艺系统、静设备、管道、阀门设计，设备布置所需框架结构及土建基础设计、新增循环水地管设计、新增阀门仪表设计、消防设计、电气设计、电信设计、总图及相关辅助设施设计等。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一期高压氧气（一期空分冷箱改造）互联互通项目，拟改造</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">K1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">空分装置，以及提升其高压氧气产品压力，详细设计工作内容包括但不限于：更换高压板式换热器；更换液氧流程泵；更换冷箱内相应的氧气管线；更换对应管线上的阀门及仪表；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">78bara</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">与</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">54bara</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高压氧气联通管线、联通阀、减压阀、防爆墙；互联氧气减压阀控制、一</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期管网联通运行逻辑联锁；新增互联互通管道；其他涉及的相关辅助设施等，确保项目运行的安全、完整性。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具体详见第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限为合同签订之日起至双方职责履行结束之日止。其中，合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">90</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历日内完成设计工作并出图，且保证工程设计与项目总体的统一性、整体性和合理性。项目正式开始实施日期以招标人正式通知时间为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务质量：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">满足招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">要求，设计交付文件经甲方审查合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK7\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK8\"></a>3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）投标人须具有行政主管部门颁发的工程设计综合甲级资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">或化工石化医药行业（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">化工工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）专业工程设计甲级资质或化工石化医药行业工程设计甲级资质；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效的《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》，许可子项目包含：压力管道设计</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&mdash;&mdash;工业管道</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">GC1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 15.7500pt left blank 21.0000pt left blank 311.2500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2010</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期期间，至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份处理有效气量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0000</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">Nm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上的合成气变换装置设计</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩，或单套制氧能力</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">80000Nm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上的空分装置设计业绩，或合成气变换装置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包业绩，或空分装置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包业绩。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">【有效业绩以合同文件复印件为准，合同应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、双方盖章签字页，有效时间以合同签订日期为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">可提供技术协议补充合同内容或经项目建设业主单位加盖有效公章的书面证明文件，以此完成相关内容佐证】。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">人员要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 15.7500pt left blank 21.0000pt left blank 311.2500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目经理（负责人）：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具备注册建筑师执业资格，或注册化工工程师执业资格，或注册结构工程师执业资格，或化工相关专业高级及以上专业技术职称；拟派人员如</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">注册建筑师、注册结构工程师，则须同时配备本单位注册化工工程师作为工艺专业负责人；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">且曾担任过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合成气变换装置设计</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（或</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包）项目，或</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套空分装置设计（或</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包）项目的项目经理。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">有效业绩以合同文件或业主单位出具的证明文件为准，须体现项目经理的姓名、职位</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，且不得同时担任其他在实施设计项目的项目经理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">需提供项目经理无在建项目承诺书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；项目经理需为投标人本单位员工，须提供本单位有效社保证明</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">起</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'ye