 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span>9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、开标方式：通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为</span>30<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分钟。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-fami