widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目空分装置珠光砂材料采购</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26B2SXQY0528</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 10.0000pt; text-indent: -10.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省，榆林市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk17227348\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标项目为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目空分装置珠光砂材料采购，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、项目名称：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目空分装置珠光砂材料采购。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2、项目概况：</span><a name=\"_Toc42335069\"></a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">榆林化学</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期一阶段项目空分装置</span>5套空分冷箱、泵箱、后备系统液氧储槽、液氮储槽及泵箱的保冷材料</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">珠光砂；材料供货包含制造、检验、包装、运输、现场发泡输送；珠光砂材料总量包括安装损耗以及振实补充余量，</span>5套冷箱及后备储槽珠光砂现场发泡输送，余量按35%考虑，袋装供货余量按照20%考虑，首次装填珠光砂后24个月，设备运行12个月内补填珠光砂的量，珠光砂需求总量6万m&sup3;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、招标范围</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK25\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购范围二期一阶段项目空分装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5套冷箱、1套后备泵箱储槽及3套后</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">备低温</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">贮槽珠光砂的供货、运输、现场膨化、气力输送售后质保全流程服务，中标人确定后，以框架协议订单的形式进行供货，可进行分批次交付，按照实际使用量进行结算，最大结算量不超过暂估数量。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、交货地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场指定地点交货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、交货期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">初步交货时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年10月30日，具体交货时间提前两周通知发货。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自最后一批货物投入使用之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月，或自最后一批货物验收合格之日起18个月，二者以先届满之日为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7、框架协议有效期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">框架协议有效期自协议生效之日起至双方在框架协议中的义务均已履行完毕之日止。自框架协议生效之日起，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">24个月后或已生效标准采购订单累计价款超过本框架协议暂估总价后（以先到者为准），双方不再订立新的采购订单，但已生效且尚未履行完毕的采购订单应予继续履行。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人须是中国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织的制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（开标截止前三个月内）及银行基本开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须提供近三年（2023年&mdash;2025年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5年（2021年1月1日至投标截止日）至少1份珠光砂供货业绩（珠光砂供货量&ge;2万m&sup3;），业绩以合同文件为准，业绩有效时间以签订日期为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、供货范围、签订时间、双方签字盖章页等（可提供技术协议补充）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">或证明材料</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27469674\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc27469675\"></a><a name=\"_Toc15397400\"></a><a name=\"_Toc15397401\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标，否则，相关投标均无效；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）本项目不接受联合体投标，资格审查方式为资格后审；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时30分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）&rdquo;下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】，通过后按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span></span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></strong></a></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2开标方式：通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督电话</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-3732054</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督邮箱</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><a href=\"mailto:swb@shccig.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">swb@shccig.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10 日内以书面形式 （邮件发送） 向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4）提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">十、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园汇源大道</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1号</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：商务部王工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-3734228</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼118室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：招标二部范工</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029）86452114</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0528',NULL,NULL,'陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目空分装置珠光砂材料采购','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-09-03 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:01:05','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097233757381754881,'1','2026-09-08 16:01:07','1','2026-09-08 16:01:07',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'陕西陕煤澄合西卓煤矿有限公司掘进工作面定向钻超前探查工程招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260903/1280218596668080128.html','e0b6fbdada1956c7c8a866602f75403fd47754f435253e8dd7c9b54593cdae4e','82ca3ec21095046d78e32677daf6f660791a73af396e0370bd4211daab9c2fcb','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合西卓煤矿有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">掘进工作面定向钻超前探查工程</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B1SXQY0522</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin: 0pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭南市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合西卓煤矿有限公司掘进工作面定向钻超前探查工程</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已批准，招标人为</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合西卓煤矿有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称及招标编号：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">掘进工作面定向钻超前探查工程</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B1SXQY0522</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：根据国家煤矿安全监察局出版《煤矿防治水细则》要求，井巷工程掘进前需进行超前探放水工作，查清采掘工作面及周边老空水、含水层富水性以</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及地质构造等情况，为了快速有效推进灾害治理水平，减小井下灾害治理对矿井单进水平的影响，计划采用井下定向钻机在</span>1416<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进风顺槽</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1513</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开展长距离、大规模探测及治理，确保灾害治理留有充足的时间和空间，降低灾害治理对采掘工程的影响，确保掘进期间安全生产。我矿拟对</span>1416<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进风顺槽实施超前探查工程，设计施工</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个钻场，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个钻孔，总工程量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5600m</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1513<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">掘进工作面定向钻超前探查工程</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，设计施工</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个钻场，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个钻孔，总工程量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5883m</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">掘进工作面定向钻超前探查工程，施工设备采用扭矩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">15000</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤矿用履带式全液压定向钻机。（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1416</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">掘进工作面：布设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个探查钻孔，总进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5600m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。一开：&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">133mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头钻进至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号煤底板稳定基岩下</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，依次使用&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">155mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">194mm </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头及稳定组合钻具扩孔，下入&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">168mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套管（预估下放</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30-50m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），全段水泥固管；二开：&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">133mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头钻进至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号煤底板稳定基岩下</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，下入&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">108mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套管（预估下放</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">40-60m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），全段水泥固管，水泥凝固后换&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">94mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头钻进至终孔。（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1513</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">掘进工作面：布设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个探查钻孔，总进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5883m.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">133mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头钻进</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，经岩粉判定进入稳定基岩后，采用&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">165mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">190mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">203mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头及稳定组合钻具扩孔，下入&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">194mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">159mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套管；&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">194mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套管下放深度&ge;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">159mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套管下至孔底，全段水泥固管，水泥候凝不少于</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">48h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">后，换&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">94mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻头钻进至终孔。具体要求详见招标文件第七章。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">满足国家法律法规、现行《煤矿安全规程》、《煤矿防治水细则》规范标准的相关规定</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合西卓煤矿有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人必须是中国境内合法注册并具有独立法人资格，具有有效的企业法人营业执照；投标人须具有矿山工程施工总承包</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级及以上资质，并具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份超前探查工程或井下钻探施工业绩。业绩证明材料</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以合同为准</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效时间以</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">签订时间为准</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人须具有</span><a name=\"_Hlk109291962\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">矿业工程专业</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册建造师资格及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span>B<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类），且未担任其他在建项目的项目负责人或技术负责人（提供承诺书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">技术负责人须具有工程序列工程师及以上职称，且未担任其他在建项目的项目负责人或技术负责人（提供承诺书）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全负责人须具有安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上人员须为本单位在册职工，提供</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人基本信息在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">可查询（提供截图）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单（提供加盖公章的承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK75\"></a></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">04</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">11</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载招标文件，招标文件每套</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退，开标后仅提供电子普票。具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】通过后按系统提示下载招标文件</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服电话：</span>400-685-1179<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载网址：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span>/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人操作手册及</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标注意事项</span></span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</spa