ly: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc7803\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31118\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20098\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1914244455\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc20098;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc31118;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc7803;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.1</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">获取时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">04</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>日下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间，下同）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.2</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、法人、委托人身份证复印件即可以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>格式上传，投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.3</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;手册及开标注意事项。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.4</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.5</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.6</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc3809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26117\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16887\"></a><a name=\"_Toc969735531\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31251\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc3809;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc3620;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc26117;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc16887;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc969