enter\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2027</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">年度集中采购项目【煤矿用液压锚杆钻车（机）】</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">准入公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26D2SXQY0416</span>）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">一、采购条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年度集中采购项目【煤矿用液压锚杆钻车（机）】已由陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，比例<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>，采购人为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）。本项目已具备采购条件，现采购方式为公开准入。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">二、项目概况与采购范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK29\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK33\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK12\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK28\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">规模：煤矿用液压锚杆钻车（机）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">范围：本项目划分为<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个标段，本次为其中的：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">(001)</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">煤矿用液压锚杆钻车（机）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK18\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK17\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK27\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK26\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK9\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的生产制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商须具备拟投产品的矿用产品安全标志证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">MA</span>证书）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须提供赋码后的<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年度经审计的财务审计报告【至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）】；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/</span>）报备可查询（提供网页查询截图）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求（以供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">本项目不允许联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">四、准入文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">03</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，供应商登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">经采购代理机构确认后，供应商在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）办理购买准入文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载准入文件。采购文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">300</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须在上述规定的准入文件获取时间内按要求提交相关材料。逾期提交或材料不齐的将被拒绝受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">购买准入文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载（购买准入文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子响应文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;，未在响应文件递交截止时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。供应商应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开启会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">六、开启时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">开启时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">开启地点：开启响应文件通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;网上进行。供应商须用<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>数字认证证书对上传的响应文件进行解密。本项目供应商无需到场，允许供应商通过远程方式进行解密。开启响应文件期间供应商须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由供应商自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">本项目准入公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）、陕煤物资商城平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://mall.shccmg.com</span>）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>。咨询时间：法定工作日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">-12</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分，<span lang=\"EN-US\">13</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">-17</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商须办理数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书并下载投标客户端。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书办理及咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">4008206660</span>转<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>驱动及办理指南见秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）。投标客户端下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">提出异议的渠道和方式：受理机构：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部；联系人：孙文健；监督电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-65666243</span>；监督邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">smwzcgxaf@163.com</span>；通讯地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">本项目的监督部门为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">采 购 人：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">地<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>址：陕西省西安市自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>楼</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">联 系 人：郝建华</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">电<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-65666261</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">18629413445</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮件：<sp