gn=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2027年度集中采购项目【橡胶分层输送带（EP、NN）】</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">准入公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26D2SXQY0422）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">一、采购条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2027年度集中采购项目【橡胶分层输送带（EP、NN）】已由陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，比例100%，采购人为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）。本项目已具备采购条件，现采购方式为公开准入。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">二、项目概况与采购范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK28\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK12\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK33\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK29\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">规模：橡胶分层输送带（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">EP、NN）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">范围：本项目划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个标段，本次为其中的：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(001)</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">橡胶分层输送带（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EP</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">NN</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK17\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK18\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK9\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK26\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK27\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的生产制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）供应商须提供赋码后的2025年度经审计的财务审计报告【至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）】；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备可查询（提供网页查询截图）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.信誉要求（以供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）供应商未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">四、准入文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">03</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08时30分到2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.供应商须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.注册完成后，供应商登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.经采购代理机构确认后，供应商在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）办理购买准入文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载准入文件。采购文件费用：300元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.供应商须在上述规定的准入文件获取时间内按要求提交相关材料。逾期提交或材料不齐的将被拒绝受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.购买准入文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载（购买准入文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年09月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子响应文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;，未在响应文件递交截止时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。供应商应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开启会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">六、开启时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开启时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年09月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开启地点：开启响应文件通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;网上进行。供应商须用CA数字认证证书对上传的响应文件进行解密。本项目供应商无需到场，允许供应商通过远程方式进行解密。开启响应文件期间供应商须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由供应商自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.本项目准入公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（www.cebpubservice.com）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）、陕煤物资商城平台（https://mall.shccmg.com）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询时间：法定工作日08时30分-12时00分，13时30分-17时30分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人&amp;供应商）下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.供应商须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。数字CA驱动及办理指南见秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人&amp;供应商）。投标客户端下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.提出异议的渠道和方式：受理机构：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部；联系人：孙文健；监督电话：029-65666243；监督邮箱：smwzcgxaf@163.com；通讯地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目的监督部门为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省西安市自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼3楼</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：张亚光</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-65666288，18092860556</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">电子邮件：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">394930404@qq.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省西安市自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼1楼</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：刘晨、梅梦、王超逸</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">029-86366813</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">86353011</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电子邮件：</span><a href=\"mailto:sxqygjb@126.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></a></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D2SXQY0422',NULL,NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司2027年度集中采购项目【橡胶分层输送带（EP、NN）】准入',NULL,'2026-09-03 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:01:36','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097233887342264322,'1','2026-09-08 16:01:38','1','2026-09-08 16:01:38',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司2027年度集中采购项目（工矿靴）准入公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260903/1280089181694984192.html','498882e88fbfb7e4b7b869f2526e42244eaf4ab8245678dc06972fe6b92dacaa','e9cf03e1b3ac92f93ddcf35380ce459e5ce712106ddea24ae055f8109209932e','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2027</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">年度集中采购项目（工矿靴）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">准入公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26D2SXQY0424</span>）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">一、采购条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年度集中采购项目（工矿靴）已由陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，比例<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>，采购人为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）。本项目已具备采购条件，现采购方式为公开准入。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">二、项目概况与采购范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK29\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK33\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK12\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK28\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">规模：工矿靴；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">范围：本项目划分为<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个标段，本次为其中的：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">(001)</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">工矿靴</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK18\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK17\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK27\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK26\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK9\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的生产制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须提供赋码后的<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年度经审计的财务审计报告【至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）】；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/</span>）报备可查询（提供网页查询截图）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求（以供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">本项目不允许联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">四、准入文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">03</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，供应商登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">经采购代理机构确认后，供应商在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）办理购买准入文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载准入文件。采购文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">300</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须在上述规定的准入文件获取时间内按要求提交相关材料。逾期提交或材料不齐的将被拒绝受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">购买准入文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载（购买准入文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子响应文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;，未在响应文件递交截止时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。供应商应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开启会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">六、开启时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">开启时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">开启地点：开启响应文件通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;网上进行。供应商须用<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>数字认证证书对上传的响应文件进行解密。本项目供应商无需到场，允许供应商通过远程方式进行解密。开启响应文件期间供应商须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由供应商自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">本项目准入公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）、陕煤物资商城平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://mall.shccmg.com</span>）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>。咨询时间：法定工作日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">-12</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分，<span lang=\"EN-US\">13</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">-17</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商须办理数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书并下载投标客户端。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书办理及咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">4008206660</span>转<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>驱动及办理指南见秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）。投标客户端下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">提出异议的渠道和方式：受理机构：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部；联系人：孙文健；监督电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-65666243</span>；监督邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">smwzcgxaf@163.com</span>；通讯地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">本项目的监督部门为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">采 购 人：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">地<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>址：陕西省西安市自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>楼</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">联 系 人：张亚光</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">电<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-65666288</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">18092860556</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮件：<span lang=\"EN-US\">394930404@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">采购代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">地<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>址：陕西省西安市自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>楼</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">联 系 人：刘晨、梅梦、王超逸</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">电<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-86366813</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-86353011</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">电子邮件：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:sxqygjb@126.com\"><span style=\"color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></a></span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D2SXQY0424',NULL,NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司2027年度集中采购项目（工矿靴）准入',NULL,'2026-09-03 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:01:38','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097233893914738690,'1','2026-09-08 16:01:40','1','2026-09-08 16:01:40',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司2027年度集中采购项目（电缆桥架）准入公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260903/1280087446951821312.html','4890bb807d077b8b8006b597a41aa38c427e00b8bacfa6048b2c9e767a23dc83','08f34624b911b57d030921b6358d870fb3afa34834f62d165d9f75a3d4675f53','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2027年度集中采购项目（电缆桥架）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">准入公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26D2SXQY0427）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">一、采购条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2027年度集中采购项目（电缆桥架）已由陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，比例100%，采购人为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）。本项目已具备采购条件，现采购方式为公开准入。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">二、项目概况与采购范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK28\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK12\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK29\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK33\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">规模：电缆桥架；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">范围：本项目划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个标段，本次为其中的：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(001)</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电缆桥架</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK17\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK18\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK9\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK26\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK27\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的生产制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）供应商须提供赋码后的2025年度经审计的财务审计报告【至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）】；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备可查询（提供网页查询截图）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.信誉要求（以供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）供应商未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">四、准入文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">03</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08时30分到2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.供应商须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.注册完成后，供应商登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.经采购代理机构确认后，供应商在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）办理购买准入文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载准入文件。采购文件费用：300元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.供应商须在上述规定的准入文件获取时间内按要求提交相关材料。逾期提交或材料不齐的将被拒绝受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.购买准入文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;下载（购买准入文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年09月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子响应文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;，未在响应文件递交截止时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。供应商应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开启会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">六、开启时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开启时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年09月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开启地点：开启响应文件通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;网上进行。供应商须用CA数字认证证书对上传的响应文件进行解密。本项目供应商无需到场，允许供应商通过远程方式进行解密。开启响应文件期间供应商须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由供应商自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.本项目准入公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（www.cebpubservice.com）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）、陕煤物资商城平台（https://mall.shccmg.com）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询时间：法定工作日08时30分-12时00分，13时30分-17时30分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人&amp;供应商）下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.供应商须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。数字CA驱动及办理指南见秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人&amp;供应商）。投标客户端下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.提出异议的渠道和方式：受理机构：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部；联系人：孙文健；监督电话：029-65666243；监督邮箱：smwzcgxaf@163.com；通讯地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目的监督部门为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省西安市自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼3楼</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：张亚光</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-65666288，18092860556</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">电子邮件：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">394930404@qq.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省西安市自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼1楼</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：刘晨、梅梦、王超逸</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">029-86366813</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">86353011</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电子邮件：</span><a href=\"mailto:sxqygjb@126.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></a></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D2SXQY0427',NULL,NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司2027年度集中采购项目（电缆桥架）准入',NULL,'2026-09-03 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:01:40','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097233923706880002,'1','2026-09-08 16:01:47','1','2026-09-08 16:01:47',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'二号煤矿综采工作面智能化充填开采工程建设项目设计招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260902/1279861762253914112.html','031e130b01faaa240f6f08a6e05e909a1bb2bf44720a5cc790753e606e511b15','498915a6c4a5a1ae8780f5d4df21a97c3979a77384b9ac6b9c35b6434f6f390a','HTML','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">陕西陕煤黄陵矿业有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">二号煤矿综采工作面智能化充填开采工程建设项目设计</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">0866-26D3SXQY0011</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地：陕西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">延安市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本二号煤矿综采工作面智能化充填开采工程建设项目设计已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为其他资金（企业自筹，比例100%），招标人为陕西陕煤黄陵矿业有限公司。本项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、项目概况：本项目为黄陵二号煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">综采工作面智能化充填开采工程建设项目设计，项目采用</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">固体充填专项工程措施，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">将煤矸石充填至采空区，从而实现处置矿井矸石的同时，有效的控制或者减轻地面塌陷、地面沉降等地质灾害或者地质灾害隐患问题。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">矿井近三年矸石最大产量为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">22万t/a，在满足自身处置需求的基础上，项目同步兼顾黄陵矿业周边区域其他矿井的矸石协同处理，计划处置外部来源矸石约68万t/a，充填系统设计总能力按90万t/a进行规划。矸石破碎系统设备能力不低于100t/h，为有效保证矸石在投料井及后部刮板输送机内的顺利流动、防止堵孔卡链，破碎后成品矸石粒径应控制在50mm以下；黄陵二号煤矿充填区域采高大小预计3~5m，采煤机及充填液压支架选型需考虑通用性。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、招标范围：黄陵二号煤矿综采工作面智能充填开采项目设计内容包括初步设计和施工图设计。初步设计包括但不限于：地面破碎站</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">设计</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、矸石投放及输送设计、充填工作面设计以及区域内总体布局、土建工程、给排水、供电、暖通等全部设计工作。负责编制项目施工图设计（不含井下工作面施工图设计）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、设计服务期限：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目签订合同生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">60日内完成初步设计，初步设计完成后120日完成施工图设计</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、服务地点：陕西省延安市黄陵县双龙镇；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">001）二号煤矿综采工作面智能化充填开采工程建设项目设计的投标人资格能力要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、资格条件：</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人具</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">有效的住房和城乡建设部</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">颁发的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">工程设计综合甲级资质或工程设计煤炭行业甲级资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">或工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">设计煤炭行业（矿井）专业甲级资质；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3）投标人需</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">有效的自然资源主管部门颁发的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">地质灾害评估和治理工程勘查设计甲级资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2021年01月01日至投标截止日）具有至少1份同类项目业绩（工作内容包含矸石充填项目设计，以合同为准，包含合同首页、工作范围页、双方盖章签字页）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、信誉要求（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、其他要求：项目负责人需具备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">煤矿类相关专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">高级及以上职称。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、技术成果经济补偿</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本次招标对未中标人投标文件中的技术成果</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">不给予</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">经济补偿。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">五、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分到</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">10</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">18</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">00</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，投标人登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年9月28日09时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年9月28日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bo