tyle=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标二部雒（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">lu&ograve;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18.35pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-89576281/18192595196</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18.35pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">476351534@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B1SXQY0519',NULL,NULL,'2.1、项目名称：聚烯烃弹性体（POR）工业化示范项目全厂安装工程','陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司','2026-09-01 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:02:21','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097234071988109314,'1','2026-09-08 16:02:22','1','2026-09-08 16:02:22',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'袁大滩煤矿矿井水深度处理项目（二期）初步设计项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260901/1279495796613447680.html','24f1488b96adfacc87d94bf266e4568cabe35ae0bc49d6ef56bc12449b9d2ee1','0557198ae18427a0ecfb81cff296fe9ca5d2b26422635a141175a74bef9ee98e','HTML','<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold;\">袁大滩煤矿矿井水深度处理项目</span><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold;\">二期</span><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold;\">初步设计项目</span><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT; font-weight: bold;\">(01</span><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold;\">标段（包）</span><span style=\"font-size: 20pt; font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.5000pt; text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 17.5pt;\">招标公告</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 192%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.5000pt; margin-left: 29.7000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.25pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1.招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 7.9000pt; margin-left: 0.6500pt; text-indent: 27.9500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">本招标项目袁大滩煤矿矿井水深度处理项目（二期）初步设计项目已由</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西煤业股份有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">以（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">陕西煤业发｛</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2025｝495号</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">）批</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">准建设，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">榆阳区发展改革和科技局（项目代码：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2019-610802-12-03-058753）备案，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">项目业主为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">榆林市榆阳中能袁大滩矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">，建设资金来自</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">企业自筹</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.55pt; font-size: 14pt;\">出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -4.95pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.55pt; font-size: 14pt;\">，招标人为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">榆林市榆阳中能袁大滩矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.55pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">已具备招标条件，现对该项目的设计进行公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0500pt; margin-left: 28.3500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2.项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 27.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">项目名称：袁大滩煤矿矿井水深度处理项目（二期）初步设计项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">2.2建设地点：陕西省榆林市榆阳区小纪汗镇奔滩村袁大滩煤矿</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">2.3项目概况：矿井水深度处理项目是袁大滩煤矿配套的环保工程，主要对矿井水进行脱盐处理，使水质达到地表水三类标准。项目分两期进行建设，一期设计规模1000m&sup3;/h，二期设计500m&sup3;/h，一期工程先行建设，二期根据排水量进行扩容。一期工程于2021年2月已建成投运，实际处理水量约600-900m&sup3;/h。随着生产能力的提升，涌水量不断增加，2025年矿井水正常涌水量860m&sup3;/h，最大涌水量1460m&sup3;/h。现有矿井水深度处理系统能力将不能满足矿井排水需要，为了强化矿井水处理的抗灾容灾能力，保证矿井排水安全，急需实施二期工程提升矿井水深度处理能力。现需委托具备相关资质的设计单位进行初步设计、设备技术规格书编制、施工图设计工作，以便项目早日开始建设，投入使用。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">2.4招标范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">袁大滩煤矿矿井水深度处理项目（二期）初步设计项目共设</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1个标段。本项目核心目标为新增500m&sup3;/h矿井水深度处理能力，整体将矿井水深度处理系统总能力提升至1500m&sup3;/h，同时针对一期系统运行中存在的问题完成全流程优化与整改，保障系统整体稳定、高效、合规运行，出水水质稳定达到地表水Ⅲ类标准。本次招标范围包括但不限于：袁大滩煤矿矿井水深度处理项目（二期）新增500m&sup3;/h处理能力的全工艺板块初步设计、各板块设备技术规格书编制、土建(一期已建成的除外)及安装工程施工图设计；一期系统现存问题的整改优化设计（含工艺、设备、仪控、配电等）；以及项目整体配套的仪控、配电、管线、构筑物等所有满足施工建设及后期正常运行的设计文件编制，确保二期系统与一期系统无缝衔接、协同高效运行</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">详见第五章发包人要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">服务期：合同签订之日起一个月内完成。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 28.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.1投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.2投标人须</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">具备工程设计综合资质或煤炭行业工程设计专业资质（矿井）甲级或工程设计专业资质市政行业（排水工程）乙级及以上或环境工程设计专项（水污染防治工程）甲级或环境工程通用专业甲级</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">拟派项目负责人必须具备给排水工程、环境工程相关专业高级及以上技术职称或给排水工程、环境工程相关专业注册工程师。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">财务要求：提供企业赋码后</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">2024年度或2025年度经会计师事务所或审计机构审计的财务审计报告，不足一年的提供成立以来的资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及基本账户银行出具的资信证明),提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台(http://acc.mof.gov.cn/)可查询并提供网页查询截图。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">信誉要求：存在下列情形之一者不具备投标资格</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">(①--④提供承诺书，⑤、⑥提供网站查询截图)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">①被依法暂停或者取消投标资格</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">②被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销许可证、暂扣或者吊销执照</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">③进入清算程序，或被宜告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">④在最近三年内发生重大施工质量问题(以相关行业主管部门的行政处罚决定或司法机关出具的有关法律文书为准)</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">⑤被列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/xinyongfuwu/shixinheimingdan/)严重失信主体名单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 3.4500pt; margin-left: 0.9500pt; text-indent: 27.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">⑥在近三年内投标人或其法定代表人、拟派项目负责人在中国裁判文书网有行贿犯罪记录的(http://wenshu.court.gov.cn/)</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.1000pt; margin-right: 0.6000pt; margin-left: 0.2000pt; text-indent: 28.4000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">本次招标接受联合体投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 14pt;\">投标时必须出具《联合体协议书》</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">联合</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 14pt;\">体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.1000pt; margin-right: 0.6000pt; margin-left: 0.2000pt; text-indent: 28.4000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 14pt;\">①联合体成员数量不超过 2 家 ;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.1000pt; margin-right: 0.6000pt; margin-left: 0.2000pt; text-indent: 28.4000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 14pt;\">②联合体各方具有独立法人资格，且必须满足本次招标资格要求条件，并签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.1000pt; margin-right: 0.6000pt; margin-left: 0.2000pt; text-indent: 28.4000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 14pt;\">③联合体各方不得再单独参加或者与其他投标人另外组成联合体参加本项目投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 28.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4.技术成果经济补偿</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 8.1500pt; margin-right: 0.2000pt; margin-left: 0.1000pt; text-indent: 28.5000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">本次招标对未中标投标人投标文件中的技术成果</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">不给予</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">经济补偿。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 1.4500pt; margin-left: 28.7500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">5.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.6500pt; text-indent: 28.7500pt; tab-stops: left blank 42.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">5.1凡有意参加投标者，请于</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">时至</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -6.9pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">北京时间，下同</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">《榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台》（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">下载电子招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 28.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">6.投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.1500pt; margin-right: 0.6500pt; text-indent: 28.6500pt; tab-stops: left blank 27.3500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">6.1投标文件递交的截止时间（投标截止时间，下同）为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.45pt; font-size: 14pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">0分</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">投标人应在截止时间前通过榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台递交电子投标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0500pt; margin-left: 28.6500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0.15pt; font-size: 14pt;\">6.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 14pt;\">逾期送达的投标文件，电子招标投标交易平台予以拒收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.9000pt; margin-left: 28.9000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.35pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.35pt; font-size: 14pt;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7.1投标人须在榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）登记企业信息，然后登陆榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）下载、查看电子版的招标文件及其他文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7.2 电子标（招标文件后缀名.YLZ）：必须使用最新版本的电子投标工具制作电子版的投标文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7.3 投标截止时间前，必须在网上上传电子投标书&mdash;&mdash;（电子标：投标书为YLT格式）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7.4 本项目采用&ldquo;不见面&rdquo;开标形式，投标人在投标文件递交截止时间前登录榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台在线提交电子投标文件，逾期提交系统将拒绝接收，具体操作流程详见招标文件以及榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台中的服务指南《榆林市公共资源交易系统投标人操作手册》。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7.5 本项目采用&ldquo;暗标&rdquo;模式进行评审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.4500pt; margin-left: 28.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">8、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 2; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本次招标公告在《陕西省公共资源交易平台》、《榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台》、《陕西采购与招标公共服务平台》、《中国招投标公共服务平台》</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">、《秦源招标电子招标平台》等媒介上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.4500pt; margin-left: 28.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">9、监督部门 </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 27.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 2; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">本项目监督部门：榆阳区发展改革和科技局。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 8.4500pt; margin-left: 28.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">10</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p