<span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">公开招标。</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc491883078\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc3044\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3390\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况、标段划分与招标范围</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西红柠铁路有限责任公司贲红总包项目后端短倒运输服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26E3SXQY0586</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">），本项目划</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个标段。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">概况：为保障贲红总包项目半焦运输工作正常开展，需委托专业运输单位完成贲红站至内蒙古蒙维科技有限公司煤场的集装箱往返短倒运输作业，承运半焦集装箱，参考运距约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">25公里。作业流程为重箱由贲红站运至煤场卸箱，空箱原路返回贲红站，全程负责集装箱交接、看管、防护；运量以蒙维科技煤场磅房出具吨位为准。服务涵盖提箱、运输、交接、箱体管护等全流程，运输单价固定，与运距、线路无关。2025年发货量约1.2万吨，2026年全年计划约2万吨。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">运输统计表</span></strong></p>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 464.8500pt; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insideh: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-padding-alt: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18.9500pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.1000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"75\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 1.4500pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">序号</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.4500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-top: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"185\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 1.4500pt; mso-pa