-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span>476351534@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0456',NULL,NULL,'1、项目名称：1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目网络数据基础设施融合设备采购及安装','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-08-31 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:02:57','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097234222999830530,'1','2026-09-08 16:02:58','1','2026-09-08 16:02:58',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'黄陵矿业分布式光伏二期6MWp发电项目光伏组件招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260831/1279147135996002304.html','1aba18d255f02b597b47f39f0187406a8fb02ab282de13a78382a49f6e54c675','bd07caa8486676c05ee06ae311096fcad2054f2e0e644ae003921eae18145ab5','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">黄陵矿业分布式光伏二期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6MWp发电项目光伏组件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（标段编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">E6100013501260416001001）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省，延安市，黄陵县</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">黄陵矿业分布式光伏二期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6MWp发电项目已由</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">黄陵县行政审批服务局备案，项目代码：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2303-610632-04-05-335823，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目资金来源为企业自筹，出资比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，建设单位为黄陵矿业新能源开发有限公司，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司黄陵分公司。该项目光伏组件设备采购已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、项目概况：本项目规划利用黄陵矿业公司下属一号煤矿、二号煤矿、双龙煤矿、机电公司、矸石电厂及鑫桥公司等单位的闲置屋面和空地建设分布式光伏发电项目。经前期资源踏勘及建设条件分析，共筛选出14处具备建设条件的场址，项目规划建设规模约6MW，包含光伏电站建设，组件、支架、逆变器、电缆等安装。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、招标范围：1.单晶硅</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">双面双玻光伏电池组件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.组串中各组件间及组串连接接头</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、交货期：合同签订生效后30个工作日内全部到货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、交货地点：陕西省黄陵县店头镇指定交货地车板交货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、质保期：自最后一批货物到货并完成调试验收合格之日起，产品整体质保期15年，功率质保期30年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、资格条件：投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、业绩要求：投标人须具备近年（合同签订时间2021年1月1日至投标截止时间）至少1份单晶硅光伏组件供货业绩（须提供供货业绩对应的合同、合同项目下任一发票复印件及该发票在国家税务总局发票查验平台查验结果截图，合同须至少包含：合同首页、买卖双方签字盖章页、签订时间页、供货范围等关键信息页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年8月31日18时00分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月8日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）凡有意参加投标者，登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）下载电子招标文件及附件，投标人必须在上述时间内下载招标文件，逾期无法下载。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）招标文件下载流程：投标人应登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/），选择&ldquo;电子交易平台-陕西省工程建设交易系统-新点软件工程建设交易系统企业端&rdquo;进行登录，登录后选择&ldquo;交易乙方&rdquo;身份进入，进入后在左上角&ldquo;建设工程&rdquo;类别中找到并选择本项目点击文件下载，免费下载电子招标文件（后缀为.SXSZF的文件）及有关附件。投标人须在招标文件获取时限内，下载获取电子招标文件及有关附件，逾期下载通道将关闭，未及时下载获取电子招标文件及有关招标文件附件将会导致后期无法上传电子投标文件，无法参与本项目投标，投标人后果自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）投标人初次使用交易平台需按陕西省公共资源交易平台（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）的要求办理CA锁。办理须知详见：http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/fwzn/004002/004002007/20250108/efdc53a2-c250-44b1-876c-c44ab6c5e66d.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 9pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月23日10时30分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。本项目采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;不见面开标&rdquo;方式，无须投标人现场递交纸质投标文件。投标人在投标截止时间前，在陕西省公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）在线递交上传电子投标文件并完成在线签到。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、递交方式：在全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）网上递交，未上传电子投标文件或未上传指定平台的电子投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 9pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月23日10时30分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开标地点：陕西省公共资源交易平台《陕西省不见面开标大厅》在线开标</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com/）和全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、投标人须在陕西省公共资源交易中心网站企业诚信管理系统（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）中登记企业信息，然后登录全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/）下载、查看电子招标文件及有关附件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、关于平台操作及常见问题，请查看陕西省公共资源交易中心&ldquo;服务指南&rdquo;，具体详见&ldquo;办事指南&rdquo;和&ldquo;常见问题解答&rdquo;。如有疑问请联系平台，相关技术问题，请提前咨询软件开发商：技术支持热线：029-88661287、029-88661298、0512-58188039。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、开标的时候必须携带加密锁（公司CA锁）。该项目将采取&ldquo;不见面&rdquo;开标方式，投标人无须到达开标现场，即可在网上直接参与开标活动。具体方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、提出异议的方式：异议人提出异议应当提交异议书，异议书应当以纸质盖章文件或有效的电子文件等书面形式提交。异议人是法人的，异议书必须由其法定代表人或者授权代表签字并盖章；由其他组织或者自然人提出的，异议书必须由其主要负责人或者异议人本人签字，并附有效身份证明复印件。异议书有关材料是外文的，应当同时提供其中文译本。受理机构：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司黄陵分公司，联系人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">物资管理部</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高工，联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0911-5585721，电子邮箱：596170458@qq.com，通讯地址：陕西省延安市黄陵县店头镇物资集团黄陵分公司。异议书应当包括以下主要内容：（一）异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式；（二）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式；（三）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求；（四）有效线索和相关证明材料；（五）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">延安能源发展中心，联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0911-7090140，联系邮箱：yafgwwrn@163.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司黄陵分公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地址：陕西省延安市黄陵县店头镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：设备配件采购部段工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13772870639</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">411359415@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼125室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：邢若霖</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-86230838</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'黄陵矿业分布式光伏二期6MWp发电项目光伏组件','陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司黄陵分公司','2026-08-31 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:02:58','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097234229459058689,'1','2026-09-08 16:03:00','1','2026-09-08 16:03:00',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司 2026 年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260831/1279144291217702912.html','590a6f02204eb90778465b187da278ba137a6ba6a9954054851548203f3934fe','50776b4caad209e36a92b89ddd055ba2220253cc6680a37