style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.75pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.8pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司</span>2026年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&rdquo;，招标人为陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">司受陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司的委托，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.55pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">现对</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.55pt; font-size: 10pt;\">陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2026年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项目&rdquo;进行（国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">内）公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.0000pt; margin-left: 5.1500pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc22987\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2.项目概况</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.6500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目名称：陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.7000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt;\">2.2项目简介：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目为榆林新材料集团阳极分公司煅烧车间石灰石粉采购项目，物料为煅烧车间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">余热脱硫烟气净化核心</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">消耗物资，主要保障车间生产工艺平稳运行，配套</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">煅烧车间脱硫烟气净化系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">使用。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业主配套三台脱硫塔及一套制浆系统。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3项目规模：</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统配置：三台脱硫塔（浆液区</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&phi;6.5m*5.5m）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">制浆装置：一台搅拌器、两台供浆泵</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(一用一备)、浆液池6m*6m*3m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">输送方式：密闭罐车运输、罐车气力输送入仓。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">储存装置：车间专用密闭圆柱形石灰石粉仓</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&phi;6m*12m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">料需求量：月系统需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800t左右，年需求9600t左右。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt;\">2.4项目背景：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">鉴于石灰石粉是煅烧车间生产运行的重要原料，物料品质直接影响生产工况、产品质量及现场环境。为避免因物料水分超标、粒度不合格、杂质过多、重金属超标等问题造成生产波动、设备堵塞、现场污染，规范物料质量、运输、储存及使用标准，现采购符合技术要求的散装石灰石粉。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">0866-26A2SXQY0873</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目计划采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.8500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6000</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">吨脱硫石灰石粉</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选取符合要求的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1家单位作为本次招标项目的中标单位。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">服务期：合同签订后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.8500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">交货期：合同有效期内，根据生产需求分批次</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">到货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 22pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">交货地点：陕西省榆林市榆阳区金鸡滩镇陕西有色榆林</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">循环经济产业园陕西有色榆林新材料</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27897\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">效的营业执照，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">投标人提供投标截止时间前近三个月内银行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">出具的资信证明或</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span>-2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.85pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">年经第三方</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">审计的财务审计报告（公司成立不足三年的需提供已出年份的审计</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">报告，公司成立不足一年的需提供公司成立以来的财务报表</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 22pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.25pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人提供无行贿犯罪行为承诺书及在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国裁判文书网&rdquo;网站（</span></span><a href=\"http://wenshu.cour/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">wenshu</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">cour</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">t.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">gov</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">cn</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中无行贿犯罪记录查询截图、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国执行信息公开网</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&rdquo;网站（</span><a href=\"http://zxgk.court.g/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">zxgk</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">court</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.g</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;ov</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">cn</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">shixin</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/）中未被列入失信被执行人查询截图、&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;网站（</span><a href=\"http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.6000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">www</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.6000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">creditch</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">ina</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">gov</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">cn</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">）中未被列入重大税收违法失信主体查询截图；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.65pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">以上截图无法提供的，提供承诺书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目投</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">标；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.4pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.3pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27327\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.8pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台&rdquo;（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 2.05pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">qyzb</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">shccmg</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">com</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">/</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">）上免费注册；注册时预留联系人手机号应为常用手机。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，投标人登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台&rdquo;（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 2.05pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">qyzb</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">shccmg</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">com</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">/</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码、投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">承诺书（格式见附件）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.85pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;3.投标人资格</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件（加盖单位公章）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件费用：</span>800元，通过秦源招标电子招投标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">支付，售后不退。（支付时请按</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">平台要求提供企业信息及购买招标文件的项目信息，注明项目名称和招标编号）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.65pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行申请并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.5 招标文件购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间：</span>2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">31</span>