n: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">该项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">进行</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">国内</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">公开招标。</span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc15949\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc151918594\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14709\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2957\"></a><a name=\"_Toc151840972\"></a><a name=\"_Toc22021\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24152\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16500\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二．项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目名称：神木富油能源科技有限公司17.3万吨/年煤焦油全馏分加氢装置提升改造项目长周期设备采购包1：反应器、热高分罐设备采购（招标编号：0866-26E2SXQY0843）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2项目概况：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目位于陕西省神木市锦界镇神木市高新技术产业开发区，依托富油科技一期厂区原有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17.3万吨/年煤焦油全馏分加氢装置进行提升改造。该装置于2011年投产，201</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年扩能至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17.3万吨/年。本次改造旨在实现&ldquo;本质安全提升、工艺流程再造、环保治理升级、节能降耗增效&rdquo;的目标，包括更换反应器、引入热高分罐流程、新增减压分馏系统及相关配套设施的升级。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目计划采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">反应器、热高分罐</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">各一台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">详见第五章供货要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四级加氢</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">反应器</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备规格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/mm（内径&times;切线长度&times;厚度）ID2600&times;15950&times;（106最小</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">+</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.5），主体材料12Cr2Mo1VR(H)、内表面（包含封头和接管、法兰）双层堆焊</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">309L型＋347型、总厚度约6.5mm、表层有效厚度不小于3mm，设计温度435℃，设计压力（MPa.G）16.8/FV；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">热高分罐</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备规格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/mm（内径&times;切线长度&times;厚度）ID1600&times;6000&times;（60最小</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">+</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.5），主体材料12Cr2Mo1V(H) 、内表面（包含封头和接管、法兰）双层堆309L型＋347型、总厚度约6.5mm、表层有效厚度不小于3mm，设计温度320℃，设计压力（MPa.G）16.2/FV@200℃。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3招标范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">包括但不限于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">拟</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备的材料部件采购、制造</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（含</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">内件支撑件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">焊接</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、检</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">测</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、试验、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">防锈、涂漆、设备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">内部防护（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">密闭</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">充氮</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">技术</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联络</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">包装</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">运输、现场安装调试指导、技术培训、质保期服务、资料交付及提供与</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">设备系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">配套的安装及维修所需的备品备件、专用工具</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、附件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.4交货期：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK24\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">生效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">后，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">11个月内</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交付完成</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5交货地点：陕西省榆林市神木市高新技术产业开发区</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">施工现场，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">整体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">车板交货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.6质保期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同设备整体质量保证期为运行验收合格之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc17549\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc1255\"></a><a name=\"_Toc151918595\"></a><a name=\"_Toc18438\"></a><a name=\"_Toc25430\"></a><a name=\"_Toc151840973\"></a><a name=\"_Toc13115\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6900\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三．投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1依法设立：投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2资质要求：投标人须具有国家市场监督管理总局颁发的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">有效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《特种设备生产许可证》，许可项目为压力容器制造，许可子项目为大型高压容器（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">A1）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：投标人必须提供自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">16</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止日至少</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3项类似加氢反应器（加钒钢）制造销售业绩，有效制造销售</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩以合同为准，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合同应包括合同封面或合同首页、签订时间、合同内容（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">体现数据参数部分）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、双方签章页等</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">能够证明合同有效性的关键信息</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">内容，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">信誉要求（提供投标人加盖单位公章的承诺书）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">财务要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年&mdash;2025年经第三方审计的年度财务审计报告，公司成立时间少于上述规定年份的，应提供成立以来年份的经第三方审计的年度财务审计报告。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">若投标人成立时间晚于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年，则提供成立以来的财务报表及银行资信证明</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">其他要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">.1单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">.2本项目不接受联合体投标，本项目不接受</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">非制造商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标。</span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc3377\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc13177\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6616\"></a><a name=\"_Toc4022\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28936\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7833\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四．招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1凡有意参加投标者请登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下： </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】。 </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。 </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13：30-17:30。 </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载网址：</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：</span></span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html\"><u><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span></u></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标客户端下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。 </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2招标文件费用：500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.3购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行申请并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.4招标文件购买时间：</span><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">31</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">18</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分至2026年</span></span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分（北京时间）</span></span></u></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc22153\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc19223\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24346\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2215\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10570\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28180\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五．投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：</span><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">21</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分（北京时间）</span></span></u></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：电子招标平台文件递交：电子招标平台下载《投标人/供应商操作手册》，按说明操作。电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc13849\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc25432\"></a><a name=\"_Toc21620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11081\"></a><a name=\"_Toc15374\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14858\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六．开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1开标时间：</span><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">21</span></u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分（北京时间）</span></span></u></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc17509\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc12098\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10635\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12459\"></a><a name=\"_Toc21614\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七．</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他</span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm%E3%80%82\"><u><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm。</span></u></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm。投标客户端下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/45.htm。</span></span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc23250\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc14822\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16099\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24484\"></a><a name=\"_Toc32066\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28537\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八．</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本次招标公告在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上同时发布。</span></span></p>\n<h2><a name=\"_Toc30974\"></a><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九．</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc1706\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1023\"></a><a name=