dent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2、招标范</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">围：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人负责拟投标设备的设计、制造（含设备系统所需的软件）、检验、试验、包装、运输、必要的附件、备品备件及专用工位器具、技术资料（包括出厂检验合格证、检测报告、设备清单、主要部件材质证明书、设备操作手册、装</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">配图纸、电气原理图、日常维护保养手册等）；负责现场焊接拼装所涉及的焊接材料、设备、工位器具及安装、调试、人员培训与服务并配合完成整套设备性能考核验收、售后服务及质保期内的维修和保养等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，详见本项目发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3、交货期（含安装）：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">240日历天完成全套设备供货安装调试验收工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.4、质保期：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK11\"></a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">全套设备热负荷试车验收合格之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5、质量：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">所供货物符合国家及行业现行质量验收标准合格等级。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6、交货地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西省汉中市勉县定军山镇汉钢公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-autospace: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1、资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须具备有效的建设行政主管部门颁发的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">冶金工程施工总承包二级及以上资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，并具有有效的安全生产许可证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；若为联合体投标，投标人按照联合体协议书的分工内容及其对应的资质等级要求分别提供相应的资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2、人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）项目负责人（项目经理）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：须具有机电工程专业一级注册建造师资格</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书及有效的《安全生产考核合格证》（建安</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B类），且不得在其他在建工程项目担任</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目负责人或技术负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（须提供无在建项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">承诺书）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）技术负责人：须具有机电工程专业一级注册建造师资格</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">证书，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">机械、电气、冶金类专业中级及以上工程师职称；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）安全负责人：具有有效的安全生产考核合格证（C类）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）焊工3名：须提供有效的特种作业安全管理和作业人员证（熔化焊接与热切割作业）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）项目负责人（项目经理）、技术负责人、安全负责人、焊工为本单位在职员工，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">人员配备不能相互兼职，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并提供社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年1月1日起以后连续3个月）；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">注：若投标人为联合体投标，联合体牵头人及联合体成员须依照在本项目承担的分工内容（以联合体协议书为依据）提供以上资质证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3、财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提供基本账户</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">银行</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年&mdash;2025年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表），若投标人成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">若投标人为联合体投标，联合体牵头人及联合体成员均须提供上述证明材料。</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK15\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4、业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK12\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK13\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人为非联合体投标，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2020年1月1日至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已完成的至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个板材矫直机供货安装业绩（板材宽度</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;3500mm）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人为联合体投标，联合体牵头人及联合体成员须依照本项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">承担的任务分工内容（以联合体协议书为依据）分别提供近年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2020年1月1日至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已完成的至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">个板材矫直机供货安装业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，其中设备供货单位须提供至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份板材矫直机供货业绩（板材宽度</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;3500mm），</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">施工单位须提供至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1份工业设备</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">安装业绩；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有效业绩以合同复印件为准，业绩的有效时间以合同签订时间为准，合同文件须包含：合同首页、供货范围</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/安装范围、板材宽度、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.5、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.6、其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人基本信息应在&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（此项要求投标人须提供加盖公章的查询结果截图）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本次招标项目的投标，本项目接受非制造商投标，本项目接受联合体投标，联合体成员总数不得超过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2家，项目审核方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">四、招标文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">31</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">00</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">18</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">00</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">分</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -13.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -1.2400gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书的扫描件，点击【提交】</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">客服</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span> <a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">递交</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：本项目为全流程电子化招投标项目，投标人应在投标截止时间前将加密电子版上传至秦源招标电子招投标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标方式：秦源招标电子招投标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）。投标人代表须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上发布</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕钢集团汉中钢铁有限责任公司招标办，监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0916-2288298，监督邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:hgzbbgs@vip.126.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">hgzbbgs@vip.126.com</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10日内以书面形式(邮件发送）向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）提出异议的日期。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">十、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">人：陕钢集团汉中钢铁有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">地</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">址：陕西省汉中市勉县定军山镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">联</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">系</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">人：招标办</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">叶工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0916-2288298</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标机构名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼123室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：招标二部周工</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18192595650</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">zhoujianping@sxxaqyzb.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0518',NULL,NULL,'陕钢集团汉中钢铁有限责任公司冷矫直机3500mm采购（含安装）',NULL,'2026-08-31 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:03:04','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097234279283195906,'1','2026-09-08 16:03:12','1','2026-09-08 16:03:12',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'长安益阳发电有限公司厂区光伏建设项目【第2次招标】招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260831/1279093170562400256.html','b526bffd0ef9bdaf318764a3cb75bdc010dd304bc6709ad083fc476d5d6e2db2','b9a517f801f8dfd6c5b0cb93ad1562d4a0ba1f4ab347b312f3162a3ff0761c23','HTML','<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0gd; text-align: center; text-indent: 28.1pt; tab-stops: 394.9pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">长安益阳发电有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0gd; text-align: center; text-indent: 28.1pt; tab-stops: 394.9pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">厂区光伏建设项目二次招标公告</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0gd; text-align: center; text-indent: 28.1pt; tab-stops: 394.9pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></strong></span><a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">0866-26C1SXQY0492</span></strong></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">项目所在地区：湖南省益阳市</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、招标条件</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目&ldquo;厂区光伏建设项目&rdquo;已获批准采购，招标人为长安益阳发电有限公司，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受长安益阳发电有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、项目概况和招标范围</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">项目名称：长安益阳发电有限公司厂区光伏建设项目</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">项目概况：本项目位于湖南省益阳市赫山区长安益阳发电有限公司厂区（会龙山办事处仑塘村二组），场址区中心坐标为经度<span lang=\"EN-US\">E112.275004</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">&deg;<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">纬度<span lang=\"EN-US\">N28.594105</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">&deg;，场址区长安益阳发电有限公司厂区内，场址整体相对平整，局部地形有一定起伏，属于有利于建设光伏电站的地址。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">建设规模：本工程分为光伏发电工程及充电桩工程。光伏发电工程部分：本项目直流侧总装机容量<span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">6725.46kWp</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">，交流侧<span lang=\"EN-US\">5860kW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">，共使用<span lang=\"EN-US\">10038</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">块组件，全部选用<span lang=\"EN-US\">670Wp</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">单晶硅<span lang=\"EN-US\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">型电池组件。利用现状变压器<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">台，共<span lang=\"EN-US\">L01-L10</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">发电单元，采用<span lang=\"EN-US\">60</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">台组串式逆变器<span lang=\"EN-US\">(58</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">台<span lang=\"EN-US\">100KW ,2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">台<span lang=\"EN-US\">30KW)</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">，共新建低压并网柜<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">个，预计<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">个低压<span lang=\"EN-US\">380V</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">接入点；接入电压等级为<span lang=\"EN-US\">380V</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">，采用&ldquo;全部自发自用&rdquo;模式。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">充电桩工程部分：本项目在西侧停车场，安装<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">个<span lang=\"EN-US\">21KW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">（单桩）慢充车位，<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">个<span lang=\"EN-US\">60KW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">快充车位（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">个<span lang=\"EN-US\">120KW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">直流单桩双枪），充电桩安装总功率<span lang=\"EN-US\">576KW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">招标范围：本项目的勘察、设计（含加固设计）、设备及材料供货（光伏组件除外）、建筑工程（含加固工程）、车棚及安装工程、调试并网送电等交钥匙总承包建设，具体工作范围包括（但不仅限于）：光伏场本体、厂区集电线路、支架及电气设备基础，光伏电站站内围栏施工、配电房中开关柜及设备、高低压配电开关设备、电气二次（综自系统、远程监控系统含环境监测站）、在线智慧平台，在线视频监控，场站数据接入长江智慧本部数据中心设备、钢格栅检修通道，清洗管道（带保温），红外抄表系统，安全工器具、专用工具及备品备件（不具备存放条件的扣款后续自主采购），气象站等及并网线路的工程勘测、设计（含初设及详勘）、并网接入手续办理及批复、设备及材料采购、建筑工程、安装工程、已有建筑物加固、换瓦、屋面修缮、屋面落水管道修缮、屋面水沟清淤、地面场平、厂区内引水取电计量系统、现场配置数据采集柜和所需要的光纤、屋面检修步道、设备安装调试工程（含调试、培训、试运、性能试验行等）、消缺、性能保证、验收考核、技术和售后服务、人员培训、招标人企业宣传标识标牌及安全标识标牌、电网提出的整改意见措施费等一揽子工作，以及试运行验收通过后的质保责任和缺陷修补、本工程相关的各专项并网前电力验收、并网及相关手续办理、电网公司对接、业主单位相关协调等全部工作的&ldquo;交钥匙工程&rdquo;，达到招标人达标投产要求并通过招标人验收，最终实施方案需经长安益阳发电有限公司厂区光伏建设项目产权方认可，具体招标范围详见发包人要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">计划工期：本项目总工期为<span lang=\"EN-US\">90</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">个日历日，自招标人发出的书面开工通知中载明的开工日期起计算。中标人应于合同签订后<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">个日历日内完成施工准备工作（包括但不限于设计、场地清理、平整及土建施工前置工作），具体进场施工时间以招标人书面通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.5</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">项目建设地点：湖南省益阳市赫山区会龙山街道仑塘村长安益阳发电有限公司。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.6</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\">质量标准：设计质量符合国家相关技术标准、规范的要求和招标文件要求；施工质量达到《光伏发电工程验收规范》（<span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">GB/T50796-2012</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\">）、电力行业工程质量标准和本项目建设验收要求。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、投标人资格要求</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 3.1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">资质要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">）投标人须具有中华人民共和国境内注册的独立企业法人资格，具备有效的营业执照。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">）投标人须具有建设行政主管部门颁发的工程设计综合甲级资质或工程设计电力行业（新能源）乙级及以上资质，同时具有电力工程施工总承包二级及以上资质。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">）投标人须具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 3.2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">财务要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; 投标人须提供<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk205915856;\">年至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk205915856;\">年连续三年的财务审计报告，投标人成立不足三年的，提供自成立以来的财务审计报告（至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表、审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人成立不足一年的提供自成立以来的财务报表。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">业绩要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; 投标人须提供自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">日至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">份<span lang=\"EN-US\">2MW</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">及以上光伏发电工程承包业绩，若投标人为联合体，需提供联合体各方相对应专业至少<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">份<span lang=\"EN-US\">2MW</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">及以上光伏发电工程业绩（有效业绩以合同文件为准，至少包含：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">人员要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">）项目经理：具有机电工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（<span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">类）<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">未担任其他在建项目的项目经理（提供承诺书），提供在本单位<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">日至投标截止日连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料，且<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">月至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">个光伏发电工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">总承包项目的管理经历并提供业绩证明材料（担任项目经理或技术负责人，业绩中需体现<span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">项目负责人姓名）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">）设计负责人：具备注册电气工程师（供配电）专业执业证书或高级工程类相关专业技术职称，<a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a>提供在本单位<span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\">日至投标截止日连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料，</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">且<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">月至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">个光伏发电工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">总承包项目设计管理经验并提供关业绩证明材料（业绩中需体现负责人姓名）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">）施工负责人：具备建筑工程或机电工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（<span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">类），提供在本单位<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">日至投标截止日连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料，且<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">月至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">个光伏发电工程<span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">总承包项目管理经验并提供关业绩证明材料（业绩中需体现负责人姓名）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">）其他主要人员：拟派安全生产管理人员必须是投标人在册职工，须具有有效的安全生产考核合格证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">类），提供在本单位<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">日至投标截止日连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">信誉要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">）投标人未列入信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">&nbsp; （<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">严重违法失信名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">黑名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\">其他要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（1）投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（2）本项目接受联合体投标，联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">①联合体牵头人需为施工单位，联合体成员数量不超过2个（含牵头人），联合体各方须签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">②联合体各方均具备在中国境内注册法人或其他组织，并依法取得企业营业执照；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">③联合体各方不得再以自己名义单独或参加其他联合体在同一项目中投标；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">④联合体成员应当具备承担招标项目所需相应资质条件和能力。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、招标文件的获取</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black;\">4.1获取时间：</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2026年</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">31</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日上午8时00分至2026年</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月7日下午18时00分。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">获取方式：在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;上免费注册。注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;将授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及第</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">条&ldquo;投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，所有资料汇总成一个加盖单位公章的</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">PDF</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">文件上传。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">800</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">(</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">)</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.5</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">(</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">如与初始注册信息不一致</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">)</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.6</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">此次采购招标项目为全流程网上操作，需要登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;主页&ldquo;常用文件&rdquo;下载投标人操作手册及</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">驱动及</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">办理指南完成投标工作。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.7</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">有关注册、购买招标文件等交易平台的操作问题请咨询（注册审批：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">029-81613218</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">；技术支持：客服电话：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">400-685-1179</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，邮箱：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">qyebidding@163.com</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">；数字</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4008206660</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">转</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，咨询时间：工作日及周末：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8:30-12:00<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>13:30-17:30</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、投标文件的递交</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">递交截止时间：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">23</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">日上午</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">时</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">00</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">分。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">递交方式：本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">U</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">盘投标文件。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5.3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">24</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">小时完成网上电子版的提交。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、开标时间及地点</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">6.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">开标时间：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">23</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">日上午</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">时</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">00</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">分。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">6.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人应提前</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">分钟登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，按时完成解密和确认步骤。投标人须用</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">7</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">本次招标公告同时在&ldquo;</span></span><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"> (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">、陕西采购与招标网（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）和秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">&rdquo;发布。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、监督部门及异议渠道</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">本招标项目的监督部门为：长安益阳发电有限公司计划经营部，联系人：谭密，监督电话：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">&nbsp;0737-6802371</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">，监督邮箱：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">yydczbjd@cadlhz.com</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">10</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">yydczbjd@cadlhz.com</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式。</span></span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式。</span></span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span></span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 155%;\">、联系方式</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">招标人：长安益阳发电有限公司</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">地</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">址：湖南省益阳市赫山区会龙山街道仑塘村</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.