erning: 1.0000pt;\">电话：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">029-86366813，029-86353011</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电子邮件：</span><a href=\"mailto:sxqygjb@126.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></a></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D2SXQY0398',NULL,NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团有限责任公司2027年度集中采购项目（防爆柴油机混凝土搅拌运输车）准入','陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司（陕西煤业物资有限责任公司）','2026-08-31 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:03:34','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097234380420448257,'1','2026-09-08 16:03:36','1','2026-09-08 16:03:36',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目EPC工程总承包招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260829/1278332884100317184.html','0d7214583312f9fdd097ec92b87d6aef3234f4397b443194550302d331438251','9a3421d1ecdc94d218033b7c4bd5757ca13780515e5d398c3bfe22e11ec7495e','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span>EPC</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pa