ly: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span>EPC<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包，招标人为渭南高新区渭河洁能有限公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标项目资金来自企业自筹</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">该项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已具备招标条件，招标方式为公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为陕西渭河煤化工集团有限责任公司（以下简称</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;渭化集团&rdquo;）年产30万吨合成氨、52万吨尿素及60万吨甲醇装置的配套附属装置，旨在保障陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司富余煤浆的顺利接收与废水达标处理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目，处理废水来自渭化集团现有厂区，其中气化污水</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">239m&sup3;/h，变换污水 37m&sup3;/h，火炬废水 8m&sup3;/h，动力中和废水 41m&sup3;/h，甲醇精馏、C1605、C7606 塔废水 28m&sup3;/h，推浆废水 120m&sup3;/h，项目年操作时间 8000h。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本项目主要工程如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新建污水预处理系统（包含处理能力</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">28m&sup3;/h 的甲醇精馏、C1605、C7606 塔废水预处理系统、处理能力 120m&sup3;/h 的推浆废水的污水预处理系统以及处理能力 300m&sup3;/h 的气化污水预处理系统）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新建处理能力</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">200m&sup3;/h 的污水处理系统；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新建处理能力</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">45m&sup3;/h 的氨回收系统；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">升级更换清净废水回用厂房（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">222C）超滤和反渗透膜元件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">升级改造中水回用厂房（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">461C），建成处理规模 350m&sup3;/h 中水回用设施；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目内辅助单元以及公用工程设计：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">渭化集团现有厂区的部分工程，主要包括污水输送管道的设计、现有厂区管廊至本项目之间的管廊设计、所有新建、改建装置控制信号引入现有控制室，提升智能化控制水平的设计以及相关的桥架、电缆设计。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"> <a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标为渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span>EPC<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包工作范围包括但不限于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细设计、设备材料采购、旧管廊加固</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">及改造</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">土建</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（不含基坑开挖、桩基以及桩间土开挖、破除桩头、水泥土垫层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">垫层换填、桩基及垫层部分检测工作）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及设备管道安装、机械竣工</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、满足招标人有关项目现场</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6S</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">可视化要求</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、系统吹扫、系统清洗（含化学清洗）、单机试车、系统调试、交工验收、中间交接；提供中间交接起至产出合格产品全过程的联动试车、投料试车技术支持与现场协助，以及项目性能考核配套技术服务及协助；同步完成竣工图绘制、全套项目文件整理归档、竣工验收组织配合、固定资产清册编制，同时承担缺陷责任期内全部工程保修工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目涉及各政府监管部门、第三方机构开展的各类核查、验收工作，以及验收过程中要求完成的全部整改工作，均纳入总承包工作范畴。总承包单位须在自身承包工作范围内，严格遵照本项目约定的工艺技术标准、工程质量、职业健康、安全生产、生态环境保护、消防管理等相关规范及要求组织项目实施。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标工程量清单或基础设计设备表中的数量均非限制性清单。凡属于系统正常运行、检修、计量、取样、排放、冲洗、吹扫、保温、防腐、防冻、防渗、防雷接地、消防、照明、通信、控制、监测、联锁、安全防护和环保达标所需的内容，即使未逐项列出，均应视为已包含在</span>EPC<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总价和工期内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">为本装置提供工期全过程的技术服务，提供设备运行相关资料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">为工程提供缺陷修复、质量保证和保修管理服务。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">总承包方负责为满足装置开工、试车、开车等所需的临时管道等的设计、采购、施工。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本项目执行过程中若涉及国外采购的设备，设备随机相关资料的外文翻译均由总承包方负责，提供中外文对照版。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">不计入总承包工作范围内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">土建</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程中除基坑开挖、桩基以及桩间土开挖、破除桩头、水泥土垫层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">垫层换填部分、桩基及垫层部分检测工作以外，其余工程内容由投标人负责，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下内容</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">由招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实施，不计入投标人工作范围</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">460D<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，核晶造粒厂房</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">水解酸化进水及反应池，推浆水进水及混凝沉淀池</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">气化灰水混合池</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">污泥调理浓缩池</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">配套泵房的基</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">坑</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开挖</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">及垫层换填</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">460C</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">调节池</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两级</span>AO</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">出水池基</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">坑</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开挖</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">及垫层换填</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">461B</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">结晶造粒厂房</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">V<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">型滤池的基</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">坑</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开挖</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">及垫层换填</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">461C<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，回用水站内部设备的拆除工作。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">275<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">蒸氨装置区域的桩基</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">施工、桩间土开挖及破除桩头、水泥土垫层。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：陕西省渭南市高新经济开发区。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工期：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">合同签订</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">生效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5个月完成</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">中间交接</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质保期：设备及配套系统性能考核合格之日起计算，质保期限为</span>12<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 125%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程质量符合国家、行业及陕煤集团相关标准规范，项目竣工验收一次合格。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 125%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量分解目标：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 125%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）设计质量：施工图设计文件审查合格率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，设计零重大缺陷。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 125%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）采购质量：设备物资采购验收合格率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，到货开箱检验率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 125%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）施工质量：单位工程质量验收合格率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，分部</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分项工程质量验收优良率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ge;90%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；杜绝重大质量事故，一般质量事故发生率</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；隐蔽工程验收合格率</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；工程质量检验批验收一次通过率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ge;95%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 125%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）试车质量：变配电一次受电成功；各单元试车一次成功。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）资料质量：施工资料与工程进度同步率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，竣工资料归档完整率</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：投标人须同时具有以下资质：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">设计资质：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">投标人具有建设行政主管部门核发的工程设计综合资质甲级或工程设计化工石化医药行业甲级资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">或工程设计化工石化医药行业（化工工程）专业甲级资质。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">施工资质：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">须具有行政主管部门颁发的石油化工工程施工总承包一级及以上资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及《安全生产许可证》且在有效期内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">财务要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供从</span>202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年至</span>2025<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人成立不足</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表或提供开户行出具的银行资信证明，财务报表应包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、业绩要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须同时提供近</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2015</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）下述三类业绩各一项：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）进水规模为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上污水处理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）进水规模为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">350m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上回用水装置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）处理能力</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上的氨回收装置</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">或酚氨回收装置</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包业绩或设计业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项（含承接</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">或设计项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">内包含氨回收装置）。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:氨回收装置指</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">水煤浆气化或粉煤气化</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">变换</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">工艺</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">凝液的氨回收处理装置。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">上述有效业绩以合同文件为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">以上三类</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">业绩既可来源于同一份合同，也可分别来源于多份独立合同</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，合同内容需体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目规模</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目进水规模或项目处理能力）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或证明业绩有效的其他关键信息（合同中未体现相关信息的可提供技术协议或</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">建设单位</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">加盖公章</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证明）。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、人员要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 5pt; text-indent: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">EPC总负责人）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">：具备一级注册建筑师资格或注册化工工程师资格或一级注册建造师资格（机电工程专业或建筑工程专业）或相关专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">高</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">级及以上技术职称；应具有煤化工或石油化工</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">或水处理项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">EPC总承包业绩至少一项，有效业绩以合同文件为准（合同须体现EPC总负责人姓名、职位，若合同内体现不了时，可提供施工许可证、工程竣工验收记录表、备案表等能证明相关业绩的资料）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。且未担任其他在建项目的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总负责人（提供承诺书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 5pt; text-indent: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设计负责人：具备注册环保工程师资格或注册给排水工程师资格</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 5pt; text-indent: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（3）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">施工负责人：具备机电工程</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">或建筑工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一级注册建造师资格及有效的安全生产考核合格证书（</span>B<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">且未担任其他在建工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目经理）及技术负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（须提供承诺书）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 5pt; text-indent: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）安全负责人：具有</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">有效的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产考核合格证书（</span>C<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类）。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 5pt; text-indent: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;以上人员须为本单位在册职工，提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">以后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">连续</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人基本信息应在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">可查询。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、其他要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目不接受联合体投标，本次招标采用资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证以及联合协议书等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">普通</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发票。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.