pacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称与标段编号：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">王峰煤矿安全生产运营管控平台设备购置（标段编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">E6100013501260406001001</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为王峰煤矿安全生产运营管控平台设备购置。本项目旨在为王峰煤矿建设一套集成化、智能化的安全生产运营管控平台。平台基于矿山工业物联网架构，融合</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">GIS</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、大数据、数字孪生等技术，构建统一的数据底座与三维可视化引擎，实现安全监测、生产调度、设备管理、应急指挥等业务的智能集成与协同管控。系统涵盖综合门户、移动</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">APP</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、生产经营管理、三维数字孪生等多个模块，具备数据融合、智能分析、联动预警等功能，提升矿井安全生产效率与管理水平并支撑智能化矿井验收。具体软件功能清单详见技术规格书。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人负责本项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">软件产品的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开发、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应、安装部署、系统集成、测试验收、数据迁移、技术支持、</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">完整的项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">技术</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文档</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交付、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员培训及售后服务</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交货期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月交付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交货地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省韩城市王峰煤矿副井工业场区。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">维保期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统验收合格之日起</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">非软件开发商参加</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">需提供软件开发商的有效授权。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）：</span> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供连续三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023-2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近年（</span>202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">类似</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">智能综合管控平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供货业绩</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或类似系统集成</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；若投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">非软件开发商，可提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">软件开发商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近年（</span>202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">类似</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">智能综合管控平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供货业绩</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或类似系统集成</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效业绩以合同为准，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">有效时间以合同签订时间为准。合同</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应包含</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同首页、采购内容页、签字盖章页、签订时间页，可提供技术协议补充合同内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者，登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span>http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）下载电子招标文件及附件，投标人必须在上述时间内下载招标文件，逾期无法下载。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件下载流程：投标人应登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span>http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），选择</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省工程建设交易系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新点软件工程建设交易系统企业端</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进行登录，登录后选择</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交易乙方</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">身份进入，进入后在左上角</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建设工程</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类别中找到并选择本项目点击文件下载，免费下载电子招标文件（后缀为</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">SXSZF<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的文件）及有关附件。投标人须在招标文件获取时限内，下载获取电子招标文件及有关附件，逾期下载通道将关闭，未及时下载获取电子招标文件及有关招标文件附件将会导致后期无法上传电子投标文件，无法参与本项目投标，投标人后果自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人初次使用交易平台需按陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span>http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的要求办理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁。办理须知详见：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/fwzn/004002/004002007/20250108/efdc53a2-c250-44b1-876c-c44ab6c5e66d.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止时间：</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">09<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。本项目采用</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不见面开标</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">方式，无须投标人现场递交纸质投标文件。投标人在投标截止时间前，在陕西省公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）在线递交上传电子投标文件并完成在线签到。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">方式：在全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span>http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）网上递交，未上传电子投标文件或未上传指定平台的电子投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间及</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开标</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">09<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：陕西省公共资源交易平台《陕西省不见面开标大厅》在线开标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span>http://www.sntba.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）和全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在陕西省公共资源交易中心网站企业诚信管理系统（</span>http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中登记企业信息，然后登陆全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载、查看电子招标文件及有关附件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=