o-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标的时候必须携带加密锁（公司</span>CA<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁）。该项目将采取</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不见面</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标方式，投标人无须到达开标现场，即可在网上直接参与开标活动。具体方法详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督部门</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕西省能源局</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-