招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1500<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">在线分析仪表维保服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，资金来源为企业自筹，出资比例</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。该项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; tab-stops: left blank 18.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为了实现在二期一阶段项目建设期间维保队伍协助各装置工程师进行仪表安装质量检查、仪表二次打点调试、设备台账建立等，在生产运行期间进行分析仪表日常巡检、故障处理、技术改造等工作，保障装置长周期稳定运行</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">特外委第三方服务公司开展</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">在线分析仪表维保服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，为设备安全高效运行提供专业技术保障。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标项目为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一阶段项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">在线分析仪表维保服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">共</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个标段。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">维保区域包括但不限于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：全厂及厂前区、倒班宿舍，包括运行后根据生产需要进行的新建、改建、扩建区域</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务内容包括但不</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">限于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">负责</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">全厂区域内（上传</span>CEMS<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">VOCS</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">除外）的所有在线分析仪表（包含</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">PAS </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统）的维保工作，在线分析仪表系统的管线、电气、仪表、气瓶、电路、保温伴热、分析小屋、分析机柜等多种设施和设备的检修、维护和巡检；在线分析仪表配套的电器、仪表、标载气</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">液、试剂、样品预处理、传输管线、采样探头等检修和维护以及更换；建立巡检、维护、检修、质量及安全等台账，做好资料的保管、完善和整理工作。具体要求及工作内容详见第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发包人要求</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务地点</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4 </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：合同</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">签订</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生效后，服务期限自招标人正式通知服务开始之日起两年。服务期满或累计结算金额达到两年含税暂估总价时，投标人不再提供新的服务，以先到者为准。服务期满前三个月，双方可根据实际需要协商续签延期事宜</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质量标准</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">符合国家石油化工及煤化工行业检修、施工的验收规范、质量评定标准、安全操作规程、检修规程、设备随机说明书以及招标人制定的维护检修规程等</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">质量合格</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人需提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至投标截止日）至少3份石油化工或煤化工项目在线分析仪表维保业绩。【有效业绩以合同为准，日期以合同签订时间为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、承包服务范围、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止前三个月内）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&mdash;2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.2500pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：持有《安全生产知识和管理能力考核合格证》（危险化学品生产单位</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">－</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产管理人员</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">或主要负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）安全</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">经理</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：具有国家注册安全</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程师资格</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（化工安全）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、安全</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">未在</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他项目任职</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（须提供相关承诺），均</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须为本单位在册职工，且须提供在本单位</span>202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repea