'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目关键机泵维保服务</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26B3SXQY0506</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地：陕西省，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">榆林</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">关键机泵维保</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目概况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目通过引入专业、合规、有实力的第三方维保服务单位，对二期一阶段关键机泵（多级离心泵、往复式压缩机等设备）实施全周期、标准化、专业化运维保障，确保装置安全稳定长周期运行，最终保障项目高效投产、平稳运行、达标达产。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2招标范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次招标项目为二期一阶段项目多级离心泵、往复式压缩机和往复泵等关键机泵的主体和部分辅助系统的日常维护、设备点检、劣化分析以及机组的大、中、小修等工作。维保关键机泵明细表见附件《关键机泵设备一览表》。具体维保工作范围包括但不限于：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责维保范围内设备的主机及其部分辅机</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/辅助系统的维护、检修工作。维保工作范围包含机组的日常维护、定期检查以及《石油化工行业检修工程预算定额》（2021版）和SHS《石油化工维护检修规程》当中的大、中、小修。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4服务期限：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">自合同签订</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">生效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">之日起两年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">正式</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">开始实施日期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">以招标人通知为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5质量标准：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">符合国家石油化工及煤化工行业检修、施工的验收规范、质量评定标准、安全操作规程、检修规程、设备随机说明书以及招标人制定的维护检修规程等，质量合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1、资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）需具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">石油化工工程施工总承包贰级及以上资质。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有有效的《安全生产许可证》</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2、业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2021年1月1日至投标截止日）石油化工或煤化工项目的维保业绩至少2份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（合同内容需包含往复式压缩机或多级泵维保内容）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">【有效业绩以合同为准，日期以合同签订时间为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、承包服务范围、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目负责人资格要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资格证书三选一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">机电工程、机械工程、电气工程相关专业助理工程师及以上职称证书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">机电类高级工及以上职业技能等级证书；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（3）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">机电工程专业二级及以上注册建造师证书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及有效的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B证）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2021年1月1日至投标截止日）内至少承担1项煤化工或石油化工</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">维保</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩证明材料以项目合同或业主单位业绩证明二者其一为准，材料中须清晰体现项目负责人姓名</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">未在其他项目任职（须提供相关承诺）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须为本单位在职员工，须提供在本单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1日至投标截止日连续3个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.4、财务要求</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）近年（2023年&mdash;2025年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.5、信誉要求：（下列要求仅提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未被列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未被列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.6、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">(1)&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本项目不接受联合体投标，资格审查方式为资格后审；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">(2)&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1、获取时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">00</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2、获取方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）&rdquo;下载招</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具体操作步骤如下</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】，按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每套</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500元，售后不退</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">客服</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1、递交截止时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">22</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2、递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1、开标时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">22</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2、开标方式：通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督电话</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-3732054</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督邮箱</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">swb@shccig.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10日内以书面形式(邮件发送)向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4）提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">十、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园汇源大道</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1号</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：商务部刘工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-3732054</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">//</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼118室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：招标二部范工</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029）86452114</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1012113274@qq.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B3SXQY0506',NULL,NULL,'陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目关键机泵维保服务','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-08-28 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:03:45','NONE',NULL,NULL,NU