><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CMAC认证，离心机电机</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">部分需</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">EX防爆认证</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">证书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日（以合同签订时间为准）</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份额定物料处理能力：≧</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">80t/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，筛篮直径≧</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1200 mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同业绩（提供显示以上业绩项目名称、合同服务范围、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页、物资名称型号及关键技术参数等信息）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt