nt-family: 宋体;\">号文件核准批复，项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。招标人为陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司，招标代理机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称及</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标段编号</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">王峰煤矿培训中心装修工程</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标段编号</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">E6100013501260392001001</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">王峰煤矿培训中心装修范围为一至七层，装修总面积</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6468.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">㎡，其中一层为接待厅、内庭院、培训室、档案室、办公室、值班室；二层电教室、培训室、器械室、会议厅、服务用房；三至七层套间</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">16</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间、大床房</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间、标准间</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间。并包含全部楼梯间、电梯厅、走廊、辅助用房、公共卫生间等。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">图纸设计范围的所有内容。详细技术方案见招标文件第五章技术标准和要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">90</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历天，具体开工日期以发包人批准的开工报告为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">满足设计要求，符合</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">GB50300</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2013</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《建筑工程施工质量验收统一标准》、《建筑装饰装修工程质量验收标准》等国家及行业现行施工标准、规范，达到合格等级。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西省渭南市韩城市王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须具有</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建筑装修装饰工程专业承包二级及以上资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，并具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（在投标截止日期前</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月内出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供近三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项室内装饰装修项目业绩。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">有效业绩以合同为准，业绩有效时间以合同签订日期为准。合同文件须体现：合同首页、主要服务范围、合同期限、合同签订时间及双方盖章签字页。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）项目负责人（项目经理）须具有建筑工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格，并具有有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类），且未担任其他在建项目的项目负责人（提供承诺书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）安全负责人须具有安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上人员须为本单位在册职工，提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人基本信息在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（提供截图）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单（提供加盖公章的承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）（提供加盖公章的承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">28</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）凡有意参加投标者，登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）下载电子招标文件及附件，投标人必须在上述时间内下载招标文件，逾期无法下载。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）招标文件下载流程：投标人应登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），选择&ldquo;电子交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省工程建设交易系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新点软件工程建设交易系统企业端&rdquo;进行登录，登录后选择&ldquo;交易乙方&rdquo;身份进入，进入后在左上角&ldquo;建设工程&rdquo;类别中找到并选择本项目点击文件下载，免费下载电子招标文件（后缀为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">.SXSZF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的文件）及有关附件。投标人须在招标文件获取时限内，下载获取电子招标文件及有关附件，逾期下载通道将关闭，未及时下载获取电子招标文件及有关招标文件附件将会导致后期无法上传电子投标文件，无法参与本项目投标，投标人后果自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人初次使用交易平台需按陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的要求办理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁。办理须知详见：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/fwzn/004002/004002007/20250108/efdc53a2-c250-44b1-876c-c44ab6c5e66d.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。本项目采用&ldquo;不见面开标&rdquo;方式，无须投标人现场递交纸质投标文件。投标人在投标截止时间前，在陕西省公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）在线递交上传电子投标文件并完成在线签到。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）网上递交，未上传电子投标文件或未上传指定平台的电子投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省公共资源交易平台《陕西省不见面开标大厅》在线开标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: 