grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的生产制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商须具备拟投产品的矿用产品安全标志证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">MA</span>证书）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须提供赋码后的<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年度经审计的财务审计报告【至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表）】；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK26;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/</span>）报备可查询（提供网页查询截图）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求（以供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK30;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK17;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">本项目不允许联合体。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">四、准入文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">27</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">03</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">未在陕煤物资商城平台注册的供应商，按以下流程：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商在陕煤物资商城平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://mall.shccmg.com</span>）（或点击新注册供应商）先注册供应商账号、注册完成后登录供应商账号完善企业信息及个人信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商完善信息后，在陕煤物资商城平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://mall.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书，增加委托代理人姓名、手机号码、完整项目名称以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）经采购人工作人员在陕煤物资商城平台审核后，供应商通过陕煤物资商城平台跳转至秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>），办理缴费事宜后下载准入文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">已在陕煤物资商城平台注册的供应商，按以下流程：</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商登录陕煤物资商城平台供应商端（或点击完善供应商信息），按需完善企业信息及个人信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商完善信息后，在陕煤物资商城平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://mall.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书，增加委托代理人姓名、手机号码、完整项目名称以及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）经采购人工作人员在陕煤物资商城平台审核后，供应商通过陕煤物资商城平台跳转至秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>），办理缴费事宜后下载准入文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须在上述规定的获取时间内按要求提交申请材料。逾期提交或材料不齐的申请将被拒绝受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">准入文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">300</span>元，售后不退。购买准入文件的发票，待采购代理机构开具后供应商可在秦源招标电子招标平台下载（购买准入文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">17</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子响应文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;，未在响应文件递交截止时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。供应商应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开启会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">六、开启时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">开启时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">17</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"ListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">开启地点：开启响应文件通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;网上进行。供应商须用<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>数字认证证书对上传的响应文件进行解密。本项目供应商无需到场，允许供应商通过远程方式进行解密。开启响应文件期间供应商须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由供应商自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">本项目准入公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）、陕煤物资商城平台</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-hei