o-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196409\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1.招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目玉华煤矿柴家沟井</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">42228工作面物探服务项目，资金为企业自筹，项目已具备招标条件，招标人为陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc438\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427364\"></a><a name=\"_Toc428196410\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.项目概况及招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：玉华煤矿柴家沟井42228工作面物探服务项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc20281\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2招标概况：本次计划在42228工作面两顺槽掘进前，采用定向长钻孔技术结合孔中物探方法（钻孔瞬变电磁法、钻孔地质雷达和自然伽马测井）探查前方目标区域煤层起伏变化以及构造、煤岩层破碎带发育情况及钻孔中心轴线半径30m范围内岩层低阻异常分布特征，设计孔中物探工作量</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3360</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">m。</span></p>\n<p class=\"23\" style=\"margin-top: 0.2000pt; margin-left: 0.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3 招标范围：全部勘探工作、提交相关成果报告及图纸，共一个标段。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">见</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4服务期：60日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5服务地点：陕西省铜川市宜君县太安镇马坊村&zwnj;玉华煤矿柴家沟井指定地点。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\">