nt-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，资金为企业自筹，项目已具备招标条件，招标人为陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196410\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc438\"></a><a name=\"_Toc399427364\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.项目概况及招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc20281\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.2招标概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据国家矿山安全监察局颁布的《矿山隐蔽致灾因素普查规范》和国家矿山安全监察局陕西局《陕西省煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查治理工作指导意见》（矿安陕〔</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025〕59号）文件要求，按照陕西煤业《关于开展矿井隐蔽致灾因素普查方案和报告审查及结果报告的通知》（陕西煤业发〔2025〕153号）文件安排，为切实做好铜川矿业下辖4处煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查、治理工作，结合矿井未来3～5年生产规划进行隐蔽致灾因素普查、治理，现需开展下辖玉华煤矿玉华井、玉华煤矿柴家沟井、下石节煤矿和陈家山煤矿等4处煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查工作，编制《煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查工作方案》《隐蔽致灾因素普查报告》，并依据隐蔽致灾因素普查结果，针对性地编制各煤矿《隐蔽致灾因素治理方案》。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.2000pt; margin-left: 0.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3 招标范围：本标段主要针对铜川矿业的玉华煤矿玉华井、玉华煤矿柴家沟井、下石节煤矿、陈家山煤矿隐蔽致灾因素，拟采用资料收集、航测遥感、现场调查、地面物探、井上下钻探与试验等综合普查方法开展工作，共计划实施四部分工作量，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">见</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4服务期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5服务地点：陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; 