mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本次资格预审</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">公告</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）和中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门及异议投诉渠道</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8.1</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目监督部门</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司招标办</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，联系人：曹经理，</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">监督电话</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0913-2026676，</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">监督邮箱</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span><a href=\"mailto:swgyzbb@qq.com\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">swgyzbb@qq.com</span></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8.2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">异议渠道及方式：申请人或其他利害关系人对本资格预审公告及资格预审文件内容有异议的，应在资格预审申请文件递交</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止时间前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3日内以书面形式</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（邮件发送）向招标人提出</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text