ze: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 9.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\" style=\"tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">重庆市</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合川区，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">双槐镇。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark3\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc7676\"></a><a name=\"_Toc4824\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目陕煤电力合川</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-24包:空压机及后处理设备采购，招标人为陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">二次</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark4\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc17515\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2425\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：陕煤电力合川2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-24包:空压机及后处理设备。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：0866-26C2SXQY0457</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3项目概况：本期工程建设规模为2&times;1000MW超超临界一次再热燃煤发电机组，采用湿式冷却方式，同步建设高效烟气脱硫、脱硝装置、除尘设施等。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.4招标范围：本次采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">离心式空压机、微油螺杆式单级压缩空压机、压缩热再生吸附式干燥机、鼓风外加热再生吸附式干燥机</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">等后处理设备，技术要求详见招标文件第五章供货要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.5交货期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月开始供货</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，设备交货进度应满足工程进度的要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.6质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">两台机组全部通过工程竣工验收起</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">一年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.7交货地点：重庆市合川区双槐镇陕煤电力合川2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目施工现场(车板)。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark9\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12072\"></a><a name=\"_Toc818\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc21655\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc5513\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目接受代理商投标，代理商投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">须提供制造厂商针对本项目的授权书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc15436\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11500\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年至 2025年的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的企业需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告。财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc10579\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.3.1合同业绩：投标人须提供自2021年1月1日至投标截止时间内，至少具有国内3份空压机设备的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">供货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">品牌合同业绩（不包含改造业绩，业绩满足以下任一条件即可：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.单份合同同时包含离心式空压机与螺杆式空压机，共3份；2.离心式空压机和螺杆式空压机分别3份合同），投标人提供供货合同复印件首页、供货设备清单页、双方盖章签字页（业绩以合同签订时间为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.3.2运行业绩:投标人须提供自2021年1月1日至投标截止时间内（投运时间至投标截止时间超过一年即可）应至少具有国内1份空压机设备运行1年及以上</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">运行品牌</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩（不包含改造业绩，业绩满足以下任一条件即可：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.单份合同同时包含离心式空压机与螺杆式空压机；2.离心式空压机和螺杆式空压机分别1份合同）需提供合同复印件首页、供货设备清单页、双方盖章签字页及用户证明材料。（用户证明须由最终用户盖章，可以是运行验收证明、使用证明、回访记录或其他能证明合同标的物已投运材料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4.1投标人未列入信用中国(</span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">v.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">) 严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4.2投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(</span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">) &nbsp;严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNorm