y: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">00</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">31</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">18</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2、</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">获取方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">制造商针对本项目唯一有效的授权书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等资料，点击【提交】，通过后按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500元/套，售后不退，开标结束后仅提供增值税普通电子发票。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;客服，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1、</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.2、</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1、</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2、</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标方式：通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30分钟。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacer