体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">中</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">化学（内蒙古）新材料有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30万吨</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">/</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">年</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">年煤制乙二醇项目物流服务框架采购</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:0866-26A3SXQY0845）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地：陕西省，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">榆林</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Hlk17227348\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为中化学（内蒙古）新材料有限责任公司</span> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">30万吨/年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤制乙二醇项目物流服务框架采购，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目概况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中化学（内蒙古）新材料有限责任公司是中国化学工程集团有限公司和陕西煤业化工集团有限公司的重点投资项目，内蒙新材</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30万吨/年煤制乙二醇项目占地1180亩，位于内蒙古通辽市扎鲁特旗鲁北镇。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2招标范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责中化学（内蒙古）新材料有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30万吨/年煤制乙二醇的门到门全程物流服务。服务范围涵盖公路短驳、铁路、水路运输及末端配送等全部环节。投标人须负责提供符合技术要求的罐箱等装载设备，并承担运输全过程的货物安全、质量及因自身原因导致的滞期等全部费用与风险，确保货物安全、准时送达。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">内蒙古通辽市扎鲁特旗鲁北镇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4服务期限：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2年</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，具体以合同约定为准。服务期满或累计结算金额达到</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">两</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年含税</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">暂定</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总价时，投标人不再提供新的服务，以先到者为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质量标准：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">满足运输质量要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）设备标准：提供的罐箱等装载设备，其设计、制造、材质、清洁度及功能（如GPS定位、防渗漏）须严格符合合同约定的技术规范及国家、铁路、海运等相关法规。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）过程标准：运输全过程须安全、准时，货物无短少、破损、污染或毁灭。严格执行&ldquo;先赔付后定责&rdquo;原则。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）管理标准：建立完善的安全、环保管理体系，确保人员、车辆资质合规，操作规范，杜绝各类违章行为，并接受甲方的监督、考核与处罚。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">入围</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务商数量：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">拟定选择</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2家服务商与招标人签署合同</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2020年1月1日至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标截止日大宗液体货物</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">罐箱</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">多式联运业绩至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项【有效业绩以合同为准，日期以合同签订时间为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、合同主要范围页、合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）】</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">财务要求</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止时间前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须提供连续三年（2023年-2025年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）本项目不接受联合体投标，资格审查方式为资格后审；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年8月21日8时00分至2026年8月28日18时00分（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">北京时间，节假日接受文件购买）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2获取方式：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件、加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招标平台系统的供应商/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">11</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标二期电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。详见附件&ldquo;操作手册&rdquo;、&ldquo;数字证书办理指南&rdquo;、&ldquo;上海CA驱动-显卡助手&rdquo;。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">逾期送达的投标文件，电子招标投标交易平台将予以拒收。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9时00分（北</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">京时间）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc21305\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2开标地点：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标二期电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目招标公告在</span><a href=\"https://bulletin.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://bulletin.cebpubservice.com/）和陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议投诉渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：周工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150