 宋体;\">0866-26A2SXQY0849</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span><a name=\"br1_1\"></a></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"br1_2\"></a><a name=\"br1_8\"></a><a name=\"br1_7\"></a><a name=\"br1_6\"></a><a name=\"br1_3\"></a><a name=\"br1_5\"></a><a name=\"br1_4\"></a><a name=\"br1_0\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 10.0000pt; text-indent: -10.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省，榆林市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk17227348\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司气体工厂洗氨塔采购，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、项目名称：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司气体工厂洗氨塔采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2、项目概况：</span><a name=\"_Toc42335069\"></a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180万吨/年乙二醇工程项目建于陕西榆林榆神工业园区清水煤化学工业园内。采用当地丰富的煤炭及粉焦资源为原料，采用国内先进的气化技术制取粗合成气，粗合成气再经变换和净化后，深冷分离H2/CO之后将合格CO、H2产品送往DMO装置和乙二醇装置，最终产品为乙二醇。气化装置和乙二醇装置所需的氧气由本项目配套建设的空分装置供给。项目主要工艺生产装置包括：煤储运装置、气化装置、净化装置（包括变换、甲醇洗、硫回收、冰机）、H2/CO分离装置（深冷分离、H2变压吸附、PSA循环气压缩）、草酸二甲酯（DMO）装置、乙二醇装置、热电装置、空分装置及公用工程（包括全厂外管及公用系统、火炬、循环水站等）、辅助设施。本次采购1台洗氨塔&Phi;4300&times;15500&times;60 Q345R+S22053/4.5Mpa/65℃</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、招标范围</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK25\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">洗氨塔</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1台：&Phi;4300&times;15500&times;60 Q345R+S22053/4.5Mpa/65℃。投标人负责洗氨塔本体、预焊件及其它附件，运输用支撑件及安装及维修所需的随机备件、专用工具等，包括但不限于上述设备的制造、运输交付、相关技术服务及提供与其配套的安装维修所需的备品备件、专用工具及技术资料等所有要求的为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、交货地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场指定地点交货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、交货期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2027年2月28日前全部交付</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自合同全部设备通过性能验收之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月，或自全部设备开箱检验合格之日起满24个月(由于投标人原因未通过性能验收除外)，以先到之日为准。在质保期内，如需更换某一零部件，此零部件的质保期从更换之日起重新计算</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中国境内</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">依</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须持有《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》（压力容器制造</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">A1级）且在有效期内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（开标截止前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供连续三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年-2025年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须提</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2021年1月1日至投标截止日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1份</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">塔器供货业绩，业绩以合</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">同文件为准，有效时间以签订日期为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、供货范围、签订时间、双方签字盖章页等（可提供技术协议补充）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4信誉要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">主体</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc15397400\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc27469674\"></a><a name=\"_Toc15397401\"></a><a name=\"_Toc27469675\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标，否则，相关投标均无效；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）本项目不接受联合体投标，不接受代理商投标，资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年8月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">21</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年8月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">28</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（北京时间，节假日接受文件购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2获取方式：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">点击</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招标平台系统的供应商/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1、递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">15</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时00分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">北京时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2、递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1开标时间：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">15</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时00分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2开标方式</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、发布公告媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://bulletin.cebpubservice.com/）和陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及异议投诉渠道</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：王工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督电话</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-3732054</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督邮箱</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><a href=\"mailto:swb@shccig.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">swb@shccig.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日内以书面形式</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">邮件发送）向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">十</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc15528\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc22985\"></a><a name=\"_Toc29913\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24990\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> 标 人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc19626\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc6911\"></a><a name=\"_Toc4145\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20452\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> 址：陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园汇源大道1号</span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc12624\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc21707\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10326\"></a><a name=\"_Toc21940\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> 系 人：王工</span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc690