so-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省榆林市榆阳区孟家湾乡马大滩马场村结合部</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">刘</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; 