n: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">203</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">箱：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1786720693</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26A3SXQY0647',NULL,NULL,'2.1项目名称:陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级项目',NULL,'2026-08-21 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:06:15','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097235056764551169,'1','2026-09-08 16:06:17','1','2026-09-08 16:06:17',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'陕西省煤层气开发利用有限公司钻井分公司电驱压裂橇成套设备购置项目（第一批）招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260820/1275162164042137600.html','e22b0c4d726ae2ae4a3b4ce3359460f16f3c1535387ca55a1daa89d9793bfcaf','5a1dc5684366e2632913843aad6aa5373000aee5f8ddc7683880a5fd4fcb3533','HTML','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西省煤层气开发利用有限公司钻井分公司电驱压裂橇成套设备购置项目（第一批）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 15pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 15pt;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 15pt;\">0866-26D2SXQY0349</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 15pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">省，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">渭南市</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西省煤层气开发利用有限公司钻井分公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电驱压裂橇成套设备购置项目（第一批）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源企业自筹：比例100%，招标人为陕西省煤层气开发利用有限公司钻井分公司。本项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1、项目概况：通过网电或35kV移动变电站开关柜引入10kV高压电，实现给变频器橇、高压变电整流单元供电。变频器橇接入10kV线路，通过变压器整流，变频器逆变，输出3300VAC或6600VAC，满足2台电驱压裂橇电机驱动要求。高压变电整流单元接入10kV线路，经过高压变电整流单元变压器，主变压器容量1,250kVA，输出电压1600VDC或690VAC，辅助变压器容量1,000kVA，输出电压380V。实现给混砂、混配、仪表、供液以及井场生活保障供电等所有低压用电设备供电。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、招标范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本次招标拟采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6000型</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电驱压裂橇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及配套的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2台变频器橇（VFD）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">130桶</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电驱混砂橇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1台、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">YB24-2仪表橇1台及配套的1台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">高压变电整流单元</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">现场</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">人员技术服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3、交货期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">90天内到货</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4、交货地点：陕西省渭南市，甲方书面指定的具体施工项目现场。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5、质保期：设备最终验收之日起24个月。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1、资质要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的制造商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。法人应提供有效的营业执照或证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、业绩要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具备近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2022年1月1日至投标截止日）覆盖电驱压裂橇、变频器橇、电驱混砂橇、仪表橇四种设备品类的供货业绩（业绩证明材料以合同为准，须至少提供合同首页、供货范围页、甲乙双方签字盖章页。业绩可以为一份同时包含上述全部设备的组合供货合同，也可以为多份独立供货合同）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">主体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">信息</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年08月21日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">08时30分到</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年08月28日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">18时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1、投标人须在&ldquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">//qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&rdquo;上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&rdquo;（http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">//qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3、经</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标机构</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">确认后，投标人可在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&rdquo;选择&ldquo;网上支付&rdquo;扫码办理招标文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4、购买招标文件的发票，待</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标机构</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">开出后投标人可在平台打印（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年09月11日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年09月11日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.co