>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接收。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: 