150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc42335069\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为了实现在</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期一阶段项目建设期间协助各装置工程师进行仪表安装质量检查、仪表二次打点调试、设备台账建立等，在生产运行期间进行仪表日常巡检、故障处理、技术改造等工作，保障装置长周期稳定运行，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">特外委第三方服务公司开展</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">常规仪表维保服务</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，为设备安全高效运行提供专业技术保障。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标项目为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二期</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一阶段项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">常规仪表维保服务</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。共</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个标段。其中：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二标段</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：维保区域包括但不限于：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3500t/d</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">气化炉的气化装置、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2&times;76</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">Nm3 /h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">H2+CO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）硫回收 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2&times;4 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年的合成气净化装置、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2&times;280 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年甲醇合成装置（包含蒸氨系统）、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">AA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级甲醇精馏装置、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12000Nm3 /h </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">制氢量的电解水装置、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">座</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">TO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炉和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">座</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">RTO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炉的全厂焚烧系统。维保服务内容主要为现场常规仪表（包含可燃有毒气体报警系统）及装置内视频监控</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CCTV</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统和安防系统检维修服务，在线分析仪表、放射性仪表不在本维保范围内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注：各工厂及装置界面划分按招标方生产部门管理规定执行，如装置管辖范围发生变化保运区域则随之变更，解释权归招标人。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务内容包括但不</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">限于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">负责所中标段装置内仪表、</span>CCTV<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及安防系统的日常巡检、日常维护、日常故障检修、备品备件更换、协助校验、制定检修方案和进度计划等工作</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，具体要求及工作内容详见第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发包人要求</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务地点</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4 </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合同生效后，服务期限</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">自</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标人正式通知服务开始</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">之日起两年。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">期满或累计结算金额达到两年含税暂估总价时，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人不再提供新的服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，以先到者为准。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">期满前三个月，双方可根据实际需要协商续签</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">延期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">事宜</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量标准</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">符合国家石油化工及煤化工行业检修、施工的验收规范、质量评定标准、安全操作规程、检修规程、设备随机说明书以及招标人制定的维护检修规程等</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量合格</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具有石油化工工程施工总承包</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质，并具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人需提供近年（</span>2023<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份石油化工或煤化工项目仪表维保业绩。【有效业绩以合同为准，日期以合同签订时间为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、承包服务范围、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止前三个月内）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2022<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial;