=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">24</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">获取方式：在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;上免费注册。注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;将授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及第</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">条&ldquo;投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，所有资料汇总成一个加盖单位公章的</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">PDF</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">文件上传。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">800</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\