001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black;\">联系电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">19911311939</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5; margin: .4pt 10.85pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black;\">邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:358698756@qq.com\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: black; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">358698756@qq.com</span></span></a></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'招标公告',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C1SXQY0491',NULL,NULL,'长安石门发电有限公司#3汽轮机组提效改造项目','长安石门发','2026-08-18 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'NEW','UNREVIEWED','QYZB_JSON','SOCIAL',1,'2026-09-08 16:06:47','NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(2097235191208771585,'1','2026-09-08 16:06:49','1','2026-09-08 16:06:49',_binary '\0','QYZB',NULL,'地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究服务项目【第2次招标】招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260818/1274318771183419392.html','7ab9a91c63e835f32102b4ab84bd9720a4f55417a1e39e143e7417087efc2a3a','c9791bcd0885c9e874b75fc803859cb548a8a006a85df0702e63e816990547c1','HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西小保当矿业有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究服务项目【第2次招标】</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26A3SXQY0678</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西,榆林,</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 10.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 67.1500pt left blank 134.8500pt left blank 163.2000pt left blank 244.8000pt left blank 300.2500pt left blank 354.2500pt left blank 374.9000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究服务项目&rdquo;，招标人为陕西小保当矿业有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西小保当矿业有限公司的委托，现对&ldquo;地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究服务项目&rdquo;进行（国内）公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究服务项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26A3SXQY0678</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3招标内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">针对小保当一号煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13盘区2</span></span><sup><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; vertical-align: super;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-2</span></span></sup><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤层开采受上覆地表水体威胁的问题，现需采用无人机航测、双环渗透试验、水化学测试、理论计算、数值模拟、现场监测等方法，系统识别地表水体与下伏含水层的水力联系，揭示采动覆岩破坏规律及地表响应特征，界定水体边界并完成水体下煤层可开采性分析，提出基于时空调控的主动防治水技术方案。通过上述研究，为小保当一号煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13盘区季节性&ldquo;海子&rdquo;下安全开采提供一套科学、合规、可操作的技术支撑体系</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。详见第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期：合同签订后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2个月内完成实施方案编制；合同签订后6个月内完成项目详细技术方案确认与基础资料系统梳理，并同步开展双环渗透试验、水化学与同位素采样分析及关键隔水层空间展布刻画；合同签订后9个月内，完成导水裂隙带发育高度预测与地表裂缝风险评估；合同签订后12个月内，完成丰、枯水期无人机航测以圈定地表水体动态边界，科学界定水体下界面，完成水体下煤层开采可行性综合判识；合同签订后18个月内，制定并完善基于&ldquo;枯水期开采&rdquo;的时间调控策略与限高/留柱的空间优化方案，构建地表-井下联动的全空间水害监测预警体系，并初步形成地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究报告；合同签订后24个月内，集成全部研究成果，编制完成项目结题总报告，准备并完成项目最终验收。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 资质要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">必须为中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人企业或其他组织机构，企业法人提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；必须具有有效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">工程勘察专业资质（水文地质勘察）甲级</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或工程勘察综合甲级资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">地质灾害评估和治理工程勘查设计甲级资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 业绩要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2022年1月1日至投标截止之日至少两项水害防治研究相关项目业绩（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩以合同文件为准，时间以合同签订时间为准，合同内容要体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目负责人</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：项目负责人具有地质工程或水文学与水资源专业高级或以上职称证书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须提供证明材料</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须提供项目负责人由</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">社保经办机构出具（或政务平台下载带电子签章）投标截止日前</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">一</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年内任意连续</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">个月养老保险缴纳凭证；缴费单位名称须与投标人全称完全一致；至少包含养老保险险种。退休</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">返聘</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员无需提供社保证明，提供退休证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">+投标人正式聘用协议，职称、业绩满足招标文件要求方可认定为本单位人员。投标人成立不足 3 个月：提供自企业成立当月起全部月份社保记录，同时出具加盖公章情况说明）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4 财务要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(1)有效的基本账户银行出具的资信</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">证明（投标截止日前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(2)</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2022年-2025年）其中连续三年企业赋码后的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件。在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备的财务审计报告须可查询，并提供网页查询截图。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5 信誉要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">v.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">)严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">) 严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息。（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6 </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 5.1000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.1投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册；注册时预留联系人手机号应为常用手机，购买文件后及时申请办理CA锁。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;3.投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件（加盖单位公章）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3招标文件费用：500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。（支付时请按平台要求提供企业信息及购买招标文件的项目信息，注明项目名称和招标编号）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.4购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行申请并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.5招标文件购买时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">18</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分（北京时间）至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">18时00分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.6其他</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法、业务咨询及技术支持电话400-685-1179，邮箱： &nbsp;qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间： &nbsp;08:30~11:30，13:30~17:30；（2）秦源招标电子招标平台投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm。（3）投标人须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及客服咨询电话：4008206660转6。咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm。投标客户端下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/45.htm。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.1投标文件递交的截止时间为2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9月8日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）；地点为电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.2逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9月8日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本次招标公告同时在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西采购与招标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.sntba.com/）、中国招标投标公共服务平台(http://www.cebpubservice.com))及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.监督部门及异议渠道</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8.1监督部门：陕西小保当矿业有限公司规划部；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-8491854；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:1015288644@qq.com%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1015288644@qq.com。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8.2异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：1015288644@qq.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2)具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人（单位负责人）或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 4; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4)提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">九</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">. 联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><