; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责拟投标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">产品</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的设计、制造、检（试）验、包装、运输、操作和维护所需的详细文件和图纸</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">指定地点交付、检验试验、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">技术服务、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">性能保证、质保期服务、售后服务、货物运输保险</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">等</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以及所有为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详见本招标文件第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供货要求</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交货地点</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交货期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2027</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日前到货。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6.</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质保期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">性能验收合格后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月或货到现场验收合格</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月，以先到为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">接受代理商投标，代理商需提供制造商针对本项目的唯一有效授权书</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">同一品牌的制造商和代理商不得同时参加本项目投标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）近三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&mdash;2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）当投标人为制造商时，须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年产能及以上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">PE</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">干燥床、脱</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CO2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">床吸附剂</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年产能及以上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">PE</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">己烷脱水吸附剂</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩，有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件或框架协议项下采购订单为准（同一个框架协议下的不同订单只算一份有效业绩），合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章页、业绩证明（含业绩用户、用户联系方式）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）当投标人为代理商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">经销商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年产能及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">PE</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">干燥床、脱</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CO2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">床吸附剂</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年产能及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">PE</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">己烷脱水吸附剂</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。该业绩可以是代理商自身作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是本次投标拟代理品牌的制造商作为卖方签订的合同。有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件或框架协议项下采购订单为准（同一个框架协议下的不同订单只算一份有效业绩），合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章页、业绩证明（含业绩用户、用户联系方式）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">被</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">列入信用中国</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span