: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc9901\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">.2开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc13554\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">．其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.1秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法、业务咨询及技术支持电话400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30~11:30，13:30~17:30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 9.9500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.9500gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.2秦源招标电子招标平台投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40