family: 宋体;\">2.7</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">交货地点：湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇闵家巷村大屋组陕煤电力汨罗有限公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>&times;<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>万千瓦燃煤发电工程施工现场车板交货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"32\" style=\"margin-top: 3.25pt; line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc1153943826\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6711\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12072\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28431\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark9\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><a name=\"_Toc21655\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1692460848\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span><a name=\"_Toc5563\"></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><a name=\"_Toc2749\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1355450340\"></a><a name=\"_Toc29703\"></a><a name=\"_Toc17231\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.1.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件； </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk235631932\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.1.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">投标人为制造厂商的，须提供《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》许可项目压力管道元件制造子项目压力管道阀门<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>金属阀门<span lang=\"EN-US\">)A1</span>级及以上资质；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.1.3</span><a name=\"_Hlk237533043\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">投标人若为代理商，须提供制造厂商针对本项目的唯一授权书及制造厂商《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》许可项目压力管道元件制造子项目压力管道阀门</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">金属阀门<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">A1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">及以上资质</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">; </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">一个制造商对同一品牌同一型号的货物，仅能委托一个代理商参加投标，（同一品牌的制造商与其授权代理商不得同时参与本项目投标，同一品牌同一型号货物出现两家及以上投标人投标的，相关投标均无效）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">&zwnj;3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK39\"></a><a name=\"_Toc22249\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">投标人须提供</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">年至</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">年经审计的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc1074817394\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11500\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6341\"></a><a name=\"_Toc13930\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.3</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">投标人须提供自</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">2015</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">日至投标截止日（以投运时间为准），至少具有国内</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">份国产阀门运行合同业绩，证明文件须提供：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">合同复印件（含首页、供货设备清单页、双方盖章签字页）；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">与上述合同对应的最终用户盖章的投运证明（如运行验收证明、使用证明、回访记录或其他能证明合同标的物已投运的材料），投运证明须体现用户名称及投运时间。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc10579\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.4</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc5851\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14541\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1365381718\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2325\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3177\"></a><a name=\"_Toc29156\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20732\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20960\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26591\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3482\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28621\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.4.1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">投标人未列入信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">v.cn/</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">) </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.4.2</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">) </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">严重违法失信名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>黑名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>信息</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Hlk235537919\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk235624998\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.5</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc1704760599\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.5.1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司及其控股公司，都不得在同一货物招标中同时投标</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 18.15pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.5.2</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc20098\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1914244455\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7803\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31118\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.1获取时间：2026年08月15日上午8时00分至2026年08月21日下午18时00分（北京时间，下同）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.2获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3.投标人资格要求&rdquo;的3.1-3.</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">条</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">相关</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">资料上传，投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.3</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">常用文件</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">手册及开标注意事项</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.94; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><a name=\"_Toc3620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26117\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16887\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31251\"></a><a name=\"_Toc969735531\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.7</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.94; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc17240\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1265555972\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10346\"></a><a name=\"_Toc8342\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">客服电话<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 400-685-1179</span>；邮箱<span lang=\"EN-US\">:qyebidding@163.com</span>；咨询日期<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span>法定工作日；咨询时间<span lang=\"EN-US\">:08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.94; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc3849\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20113\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1646337601\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26517\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书办理及咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">4008206660</span>转<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>，咨询时间：工作日及周末：<span lang=\"EN-US\">8:00-20:00</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc11018\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20265\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3810\"></a><a name=\"_Toc512361370\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc6494\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6162\"></a><a name=\"_Toc22145\"></a><a name=\"_Toc901772062\"></a><a name=\"_Toc27369\"></a><a name=\"_Toc23678\"></a><a name=\"_Toc23543\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.1递交截止时间：</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2026年09月15日上午9时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc4986\"></a><a name=\"_Toc30523\"></a><a name=\"_Toc5466\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.2本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和U盘投标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc24646\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7577\"></a><a name=\"_Toc5914\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前24小时完成网上电子版的提交。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc24168\"></a><a name=\"_Toc882\"></a><a name=\"_Toc952091445\"></a><a name=\"_Toc18535\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 