0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">暖通</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">施工工程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B1SXQY0461</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">渭南市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标人为陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，资金已落实。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">暖通施工工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">进行国内公开招标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目暖通施工工程</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2项目概况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目占地约175.52亩，主要建设聚烯烃弹性体（POR</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工业化示</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">范项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置，聚合部分设置年产</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">35000吨POR（干基）的生产线，可根据市场需求生产不同牌号产品，年操作时间按8000小时考虑，操作弹性</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">50%～110%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建设内容主要包括聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工艺装置，以及配套建设的公用工程、辅助生产设施等。建设的主要公辅设施有：循环水站、脱盐水系统、污水处理站、焚烧及热回收、消防系统、生产办公室、化验室、控制室、备品备件库、综合机修、化学品库、火炬等。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3招标范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目暖通施工工程。包括但不限于：泵房、后处理包装工序、成品仓库、含镍废水处理设施、主催化剂配制、控制室、变电所、生产办公室、化验室、化学品库B、危废暂存库、备品备件库、换热站、综合泵站、循环水站、综合机修间、人流大门及门卫、 门卫2及地磅房等单元的所有采暖、通风空调和防排烟工程的设备、材料的采购和管道、设备、防腐保温安装以及为实施本项目所需的相关调试工作</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、数字化交付服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">并负责化验室通风柜万向罩等排风系统、新风系统、变频离心风机、排气吸附装置等的联动调试。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">本项目主要材料</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">均为乙供。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">具体施工内容详见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">施工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">图纸。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4项目地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西省渭南市蒲城县</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">渭北煤化工业园区</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5工期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180日历天，以发包人下达的开工指令确定的实际开工日期起算，至工程竣工移交之日止。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.6质量：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">符合国家《建筑工程质量统一验收标准》</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">GB50300-2013要求，同时须达到发包人的接管验收标准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">资质要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">提供行政主管部门颁发的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">建筑机电安装工程专业承包二级及以上资质和消</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">防设施工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">专业承包二级及以上资质，并具有有效的安全生产许可证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">且在有效期内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）投标人须提供拟投标产品（多联机及单元式机组）制造商针对本项目出具的唯一授</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">权书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（同一品牌同一型号仅接受一家授权）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">同一品牌同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">一型号的设备不接受两家投标人同时投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">财务要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人须提供有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须提供（2023年-2025年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">连续三年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人须提供近五年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2021年1月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1日至投标截止日）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">至少三</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">暖通施工工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">或</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">建设</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">施工总承包（含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">暖通施工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">程业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。有效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩以合同文件为准，合同内容须体现：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">人员要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目负责人（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">资格要求：具备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">机电</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工程专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册建造师资格，且持有安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B证）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">须在本单位注册。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">且未担任其他在建设工程项目的项目经理或技术负责人（提供承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）技术负责人资格要求：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">须具有机电</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工程专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">注册建造师资格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">或机电工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">相关</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">的助理工程师及以上职称，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">且未担任其他在建设工程项目的项目经理或技术负责人（提供承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）安全负责人资格要求：必须具有安全生产考核合格证书（C类）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上人员须为本单位在册职工，提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日以后连续</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">个月）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">信誉要求</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人基本信息在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（提供截图）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信名单。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">其他要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）本次招标不接受联合体投标。本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">4.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">获取时间：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">4.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">获取方式：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子普通发票</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span> &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">13:30-17:30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">5.1递交截止时间</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; li