QYZB',NULL,'红柳林选煤厂末煤提质项目监理服务招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260814/1272870208062619648.html','d1ae03c91931fa4f0125d54d0d2934eff5a66b0e2b7f9dfb5563277233050f68','e98d6d5f3e0534ee501d60995bfca805346159ae892d55747a876e3fd753c723','HTML','<h1 style=\"line-height: 33.75pt; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 26.1333px;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span></span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"line-height: 33.75pt; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 26.1333px; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;\">红柳林选煤厂末煤提质项目监理服</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 26.1333px; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;\">务</span></span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"line-height: 33.75pt; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 3.6000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.8500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.招标条件</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.3500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.3500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">红柳林选煤厂末煤提质项目监理服</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.3500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.3500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">已由神木市发展改革和科技局批准建设，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（项目业主）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，建设资金来自企业自筹，项目出资比例为自筹资金</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100.00%</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目已具备招标条件，现对</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">该项目进行公</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">开招标，特邀有意愿的投标人参加投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.项目概况与招标范围</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1 建设地点：陕西省榆林市神木市滨河街道办事处红柳林村。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2 工程规模：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">红柳林</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">末煤提质项目不增加洗选能力，改造后选煤厂规模仍为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18.00Mt/a。主要新增建（构）筑物：3号主厂房、洗中块煤仓、浓缩车间、带式输送机栈桥及转载点。项目依托现有矿井工业场地，末煤分选系统主要布置在选煤厂现有生产系统南侧预留场地，新建洗中块煤仓布置在选煤厂北侧已购场地内</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不再新增用地。项目总占地约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">37.5亩。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标范围：承担红柳林选煤厂末煤提质项目土建工程、安装工程、设备购置、联合试运转施工全过程监理服务，对项目质量、进度、投资、安全、合同及信息实施监督管控</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">共划分一个标段。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4 项目投资估算：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">48802.94万</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">元，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（其中本次招标项目估算为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">340</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">万元）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">限</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：服务期从工程正式开工起至项目竣工验收合格</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">计划服务期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">730日历天</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.6 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标段划分：标段名称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: </span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">红柳林选煤厂末煤提质项目监理服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；标段编号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:E6108003536d04349001</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">001</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；标段类型</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1资格要求：须具有独立法人资格并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2资质要求：须具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">矿山</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">甲</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">级资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">或</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">工程监理综合资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目负责人要求（总监理工程师）：须具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">矿山</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">注册监理工程师执业证书，且未担任其他在建工程项目总监理工程师（提供承诺</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：提供企业赋码后的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年度财务审计报告。2026年至今新成立的公司须提供基本户银行资信证明。在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备的财务审计报告须可查询，并提供网页查询截图。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求：投标申请人及拟派项目负责人信息应在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省住房和城乡建设厅&rdquo;网站录入并可查询，提供查询截图。投标人存在下列情形之一者不具备投标资格（1-4项提供承诺书，5-6项提供网查截图）：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">①被依法暂停或者取消投标资格；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">②被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销许可证、暂扣或者吊销执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">③进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">④在最近三年内发生重大</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">质量问题（以相关行业主管部门的行政处罚决定或司法机关出具的有关法律文书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">⑤被列入信用中国（https：//www.creditchina.gov.cn/xinyongfuwu/shixinheimingdan/）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">⑥在近三年内投标人和其法定代表人、拟派项目负责人在中国裁判文书网有行贿犯罪记录的（http：//wenshu.court.gov.cn/）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标接受联合体投标；联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">①组成联合体成员数量不超过2家；②联合体各方具有独立法人资格，且必须满足本次招标资格要求条件，并签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；③联合体各方不得再单独参加或者与其他投标人另外组成联合体参加本项目投标，投标时必须出具《联合体协议书》。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.资格审查方法</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.招标文件的获取</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">14</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17时00分起至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">19</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17时00分从《榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台》（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.投标文件的递交</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1 投标文件递交的截止时间(投标截止时间，下同)为2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时30分，地点为通过《榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台》系统上传递交投标文件，并在不见面开标大厅完成签到。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2 逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7.发布公告的媒介</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在《全国公共资源交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(陕西省&middot;榆林市)榆林市公共资源交易中心》、 《陕西采购与招标网》、《中国招投标公共服务平台》 、《秦源招标电子招标平台》等媒介上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.其他</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.1 招投标人须在须在榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）登记企业信息，然后登陆榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）下载、查看电子版的招标文件及其他文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.2 电子标（招标文件后缀名.YLZ）：必须使用最新版本的电子投标工具制作电子版的投标文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.3 投标截止时间前，必须在网上上传电子投标书&mdash;&mdash;（电子标：投标书为YLT格式）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.4 该项目采取&ldquo;不见面 &rdquo;开标方式， 投标单位无须到达开标现场，具体要求详见招标文件规定。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.5接收异议联系人和联系方式：陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司审计部，电话：0912-8519850，邮箱：416540547@qq.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督部门</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 20.9000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.9000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门为神木市发展改革和科技局。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">10.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.6400%; margin-left: 4.6500pt; border: none; mso-border-le