要求：</span><a name=\"_Toc5851\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1365381718\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2325\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14541\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3177\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26591\"></a><a name=\"_Toc29156\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20732\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28621\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3482\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20960\"></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.4.1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">投标人未列入信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; text-decoration-line: none;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; text-decoration-line: none;\">v.cn/</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">) </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><a name=\"_Toc232517674\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">3.4.2</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; text-decoration-line: none;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; text-decoration-line: none;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">) </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">严重违法失信名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>黑名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>信息</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc232517675\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt;\">其他要求：</span><a name=\"_Toc1704760599\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc20098\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1914244455\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31118\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7803\"></a><a name=\"_Toc232517676\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.1获取时间：2026年08月13日上午08时00分至2026年08月20日下午18时00分（北京时间，下同）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.2获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3.投标人资格要求&rdquo;的3.1-3.</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">条</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">相关</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">资料上传，投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.3</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">常用文件</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">手册及开标注意事项</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc3809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26117\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc969735531\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16887\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31251\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.7有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc8342\"></a><a name=\"_Toc17240\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10346\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1265555972\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">客服电话：400-685-1179；邮箱：qyebidding@163.com；咨询日期：法定工作日；咨询时间:08:30～12:00 13:30～17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc20113\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26517\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3849\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1646337601\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6，咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc3810\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11018\"></a><a name=\"_Toc232517677\"></a><a name=\"_Toc512361370\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20265\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc22145\"></a><a name=\"_Toc901772062\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6494\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6162\"></a><a name=\"_Toc23678\"></a><a name=\"_Toc27369\"></a><a name=\"_Toc23543\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.1递交截止时间：</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2026年09月09日上午9时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc4986\"></a><a name=\"_Toc5466\"></a><a name=\"_Toc30523\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.2本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和U盘投标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc5914\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24646\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7577\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.3为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前24小时完成网上电子版的提交。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc18535\"></a><a name=\"_Toc882\"></a><a name=\"_Toc232517678\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24168\"></a><a name=\"_Toc952091445\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Toc1353636946\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12646\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12543\"></a><a name=\"_Toc18577\"></a><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.1开标时间：2026年09月09日上午9时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">.</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc232517679\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10958\"></a><a name=\"_Toc27360\"></a><a name=\"_Toc400355065\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20308\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark8\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">7.1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">本项目第四次招标公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（陕西采购与招标公共服务平台）（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">7.2</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台投标人操作手册下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc232517680\"></a><a name=\"_Toc5966\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1735471809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31172\"></a