\"_Toc25491\"></a><a name=\"_Toc201652950\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2425\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24415\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤汨罗</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;100万千瓦燃煤发电工程第五批辅机设备采购</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">16包：风门设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2项目概况：陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2&times;100万千瓦燃煤发电工程，位于湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇双桥村。本期建设2&times;1000MW超超临界二次再热燃煤发电机组，同步建设烟气脱硫、脱硝、除尘设施等。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.3招标范围：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK59\"></a></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">风门</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">230台。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">包括设备的供货、备品备件、运输、相关服务，设备名称、型号等技术参数详见招标文件第五章供货要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5pt; text-indent: 10.15pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">#1机组</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">签订合同后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">#2机组合同签订后3个月（具体交货时间以招标人通</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">知为准），设备交货进度应满足工程进度的要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自第二台机组</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">168小时试运行结束之日起1年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇闵家巷村大屋组陕煤电力汨罗有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;100万千瓦燃煤发电工程施工现场车板交货</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark9\"></a><a name=\"_Toc201652951\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7643\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12072\"></a><a name=\"_Toc18316\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20892\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-right: 10.85pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc4337\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc13851\"></a><a name=\"_Toc17707\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK57\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><a name=\"_Toc201652952\"></a></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc29703\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-right: 10.85pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc22722\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc28727\"></a><a name=\"_Toc19808\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.2财务要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK44\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年至2025年经审计的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-right: 10.85pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc11400\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc201652953\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7987\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1802\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11500\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.3业绩要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK43\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2019年1月1日至投标截止时间（以合同签订时间为准）至少具有国内2份新建或扩建火电机组锅炉烟风系统风门设备的供货业绩（不包含改造业绩）。需提供合同复印件（至少包含合同首页、供货设备清单页、签字盖章页）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK45\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.1投标人未列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/) 严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/) 严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK50\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司及其控股公司，都不得在同一货物招标中同时投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc13087\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目不允许联合体投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc201652957\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc17459\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20098\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12892\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28228\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">4.1获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年08月11日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年08月18日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（北京时间，下同）</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3.投标人资格要求&rdquo;的3.1-3.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">条</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">相关</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">资料上传，投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">常用文件</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">手册及开标注意事项</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-h