eight: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：山西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">长治市</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">平顺县</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark3\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc7895\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1839381047\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16120\"></a><a name=\"_Toc32204\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7676\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark4\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc12519\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2425\"></a><a name=\"_Toc291491238\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1929\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力平顺</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180MW风力发电项目风力发电机组、塔筒及附属设备采购</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，招标人为陕西省煤炭物资供应公司，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西省煤炭物资供应公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">二次</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc31045\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力平顺</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180MW风力发电项目风力发电机组、塔筒及附属设备采购。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：0866-26C2SXQY0378</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3项目概况：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力平顺</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180MW风力发电项目场址位于长治市平顺县龙溪镇、杏城镇、东寺头乡境内，风电场地形为山地，海拔高度介于1489m～1712m之间。按照山西省能源局《关于下达山西省2023年风电、光伏发电保障性并网年度建设计划的通知》（晋能源新能源发〔2023〕292号）和《关于下达山西省2023年煤电与新能源一体化试点项目建设计划的通知》（晋能源新能源发〔2023〕223号）文件，本项目分别取得100MW保障性并网建设指标和80MW煤电与新能源一体化试点指标，总装机容量180MW，拟安装28台叶轮直径220m，轮毂高度125m，单机容量为6.25MW风力发电机组；1台叶轮直径200m，轮毂高度120m，单机容量为5.0MW风力发电机组。项目自建1座220kV升压站，通过1回220kV新建线路送至平顺220KV变电站。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4招标范围</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">包括但不限于：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">28台叶轮直径220m，轮毂高度125m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（含钢塔及塔间连接法兰）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，单机容量为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6.25MW风力发电机组；1台叶轮直径200m，轮毂高度120m</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（含钢塔及塔间连接法兰）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，单机容量为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5.0MW风力发电机组</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，并</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK11\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供风电场仿真建模所需控制器和封装模型资料。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">适应招标项目风资源条件和环境条件的全新制造、技术先进、性能稳定、安全可靠、包装完整的成套并网型风力发电机组设备及附属设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/系统、中央及远程监控系统、通用及专用工器具、备品备件和易耗品、相关设计、制造、试验、包装、发运至现场指定机位及交货、现场开箱检查、安装指导、现场试验、验收、技术文件的编制和提交、运行人员的培训、项目质保期服务及大部件质保服务、调试和试运行等。具体内容以第五章供货要求为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">前交付首批设备</span>8台<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，其余设备交付节点以现场施工进度为准，</span>2026年11月30日前交清全部设备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质保期：设备安装调试验收合格后整机质保</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5年。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.7交货地点：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">山西省长治市平顺县</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力平顺</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180MW风力发电项目风机机位。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark9\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"><