; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须提供投标方案机型通过风力发电机整机型式认证、具有国家认可的第三方权威检测机构出具的低电压穿越测试报告、高电压穿越测试报告等相关检测报告。投标方案机型如仅取得设计评估，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须在投标时提交承诺函，承诺于项目并网前完成并提交并网验收所需全部报告</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc2921\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc22249\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年至2025年经审计的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc11500\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc6341\"></a><a name=\"_Toc13930\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1074817394\"></a><a 