a,同时降低选煤厂入选下限。主要建设内容：改造筛分破碎车间,改造一、二号主厂房，新增三号主厂房及配电室，新增三号浓 缩车间，改造和新增带式输送机栈桥，新增排矸系统，改造配套 供配电、生产集控及调度、智能化、给排水及供热、通风除尘 等系统的土建、设备购置及安装工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 项目投资总额：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">估算</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">494810000</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">元，（其中本次招标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">概算</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2632750.0元）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监理服务期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：自工程开工之日起至缺陷责任期满且工程综合验收完毕止，包含施工准备、施工、竣工验收、缺陷责任期等阶段（约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1380日历天，其中项目总工期22个月，缺陷责任期24个月）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc4072\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5 标段划分：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标段名称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司选煤厂末煤提质及扩能技术改造项目监理服务;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标段编号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: E6108003536d04266001001;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标段类型</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 监理;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc19256\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6 招标范围：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次项目招标内容主要包括：二号主厂房（改造）至三号主厂房栈桥、三号主厂房、三号主厂房至二号主厂房（改造）栈桥、三号主厂房至九号转载点栈桥、九号转载点、九号转载点至八号转载点（改造）栈桥、八号转载点（改造）、三号浓缩车间、配电室、二号主厂房（改造）、原煤储煤场下返煤皮带改造、筛分破碎车间（改造）、一号主厂房（改造）、二号浓缩车间（改造）、混煤上槽仓皮带改造、槽仓配仓皮带改造、混煤皮带改造、洗块煤皮带改造、矸石上仓皮带改造、矿井机修车间拆除、矿井机修车间拆除与补建。包含与生产系统配套的供配电、集中控制、智能化（末煤提质部分）、给排水、消防、暖通、室内照明等系统。以及场地内道路、厂区硬化、厂区室外管网等工程的监理服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc17181\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.7 其他：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">/</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc11749\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资格要求：投标人须是中国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：投标人须具有矿山工程专业监理甲级资质或工程监理综合资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc18009\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">拟派总监理工程师：必须具有矿山工程注册监理工程师资格证书；且总监理工程师不得同时担任其他项目的总监理工程师（提供加盖单位公章的承诺书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4.信誉要求：投标人的基本信息须在陕西省住房和城乡建设厅（https://js.shaanxi.gov.cn/）查询。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人存在下列情形之一者不具备投标资格（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1-4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项提供承诺书，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5-6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项提供网查截图</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">①被依法暂停或者取消投标资格；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">②被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销许可证、暂扣或者吊销执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">③进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">④在最近三年内发生重大监理质量问题（以相关行业主管部门的行政处罚决定或司法机关出具的有关法律文书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">⑤被列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/xinyongfuwu/shixinheimingdan/）严重失信主体名单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">⑥在近三年内投标人或其法定代表人、拟派总监理工程师在中国裁判文书网有行贿犯罪记录的（http://wenshu.court.gov.cn/）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标接受联合体投标；联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">①组成联合体成员数量不超过2家；②联合体各方具有独立法人资格，且必须满足本次招标资格要求条件，并签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；③联合体各方不得再单独参加或者与其他投标人另外组成联合体参加本项目投标，投标时必须出具《联合体协议书》</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc16901\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.资格审查方法</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc20889\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026-08-</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17:00:00起至2026-08-</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17:00:00,从榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc26123\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1 投标文件递交的截止时间（投标截止时间，下同）为2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">09:30:00，地点为榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2 逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc15962\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-