har-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">注：书面材料必须由其法定代表人（单位负责人）或者授权代表签字并加盖单位公章。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">招标人：陕煤电力信阳有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">地址：河南省信阳市平桥区平桥镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：王女士</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0376-6522249</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮件：<span lang=\"EN-US\">w19028625@163.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0