.5pt;\">3）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4）有效线索和相关证明材料。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">．联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：咸阳世纪大道中段</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">58号彬长大厦14层</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">联系人：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">郑</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; m